{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00006I5R7', 'answerTime': 'Dec 31, 2013', 'unixTime': 1388476800, 'question': 'Which shock-mount goes with this mic for recording? Is there a good reason to use a shock mount for live performing, or are they just for recording?', 'answer': "A shock mount is not used with this kind of microphone. Just a typical microphone holder will due. This microphone (e835) can be purchased for less than $100, and should come with a storage bag and a microphone holder. In fact, on Amazon you can buy everything you need for $99, including a bag, mount, and stand from Sonic Sense. Just search Amazon for e835 and you will see it. Btw, I don't work for Sonic Sense and have never purchased an item from them, just thought I would give you a heads up. Of course, the decision is yours as far as who to purchase from."}
