{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0000AQRST', 'answerTime': 'Jan 26, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422259200, 'question': "How is the noise gate? i will be using the mic to record my marshall amp i don't want to much background noise.", 'answer': 'Noise gate? Are you talking about inherent noise in the mic itself or the rejection of sound off axis sound, such as the polar pick up pattern? The best source on either of these specs is the Shure web site. Print the PDF of the specs rather than relying on opinions.'}
