{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0000AQRSU', 'answerTime': 'Feb 2, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422864000, 'question': 'was made in usa or Chinese?', 'answer': "Shure mics are made in Mexico. However, counterfit copies are made in China and Tailand. The SM58 is a great mic used professionally worldwide. Look at the XLR pins on the bottom. They should be labelled 1,2, 3 . A copy does not usually have this. A new SM58 won't sell for less than $98."}
