{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0002CZV6E', 'answerTime': 'Jan 21, 2015', 'unixTime': 1421827200, 'question': 'There are about a billion overdrives out there. Is this one better for blues than others like the tube screamer?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'There are different overdrive sounds you can use in blues. The Boss BD-2 is amazing to create a thin Fender sound, and can produce a good amount of overdrive. Ibanez Tube screamer produces a complete different sound, mid range, and is amazing for that. Depending on the guitar player or music you wanna play have must have a different setup. In my pedal board a keep both !'}
