{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0002CZV50', 'answerTime': 'Dec 24, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387872000, 'question': 'How bad is the neck dive on this model? I am teetering between this and a Epiphone Thunderbird Classic-IV PRO...', 'answer': 'I own the both of them, and honestly I prefer the goth most. The sound is at more crisp and deep. Due to the body structure there is a slight difference in the dive. But nothing noticeable. If you want my personal opinion I would go with the Epiphone iv goth. I use it for live shows and have had zero problems with it. OVERALL go with the Goth mate. Cheers!'}
