{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0002D0CQC', 'answerTime': 'Jul 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404802800, 'question': 'How is this stuff on Bass strings? Thanks people!', 'answer': "Don't see why it wouldn't work. It cleans the strings, brightens the tone and conditions the fingerboard. Should work equally well on any steel string instrument."}
