{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0002D0JZQ', 'answerTime': 'Sep 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410418800, 'question': 'What kind of battery does the unit have? How many volts, size; is it replaceable? Buy in hardware stores?', 'answer': "It is a rechargeable battery. From what I understand, getting a replacement batty from Pignose,(as you can't readily buy it), can be the only problem with this great little amp. If you charge it all the way,(simply plugging in the supplied cord), and then use it 'till dead, then repeat.....will keep the battery in shape for years. I have had no problem with the one I own, but, I do try to play it often to keep the battery up to snuff."}
