{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0002E3B78', 'answerTime': 'Apr 5, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428217200, 'question': 'does this work fine for nylon??', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I've used it on my Yamaha classical guitar, and it works pretty well. I believe it works better on your standard, steel string acoustic guitars; but, yes it works with nylon strings. Hope that helps. R. Logan satisfied customer"}
