{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0002E4ZIW', 'answerTime': 'Apr 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398668400, 'question': "I'm a trumpet player-I can't get to come out of the bottle.I remove cap squeeze and nothing happens!I want to use it like valve oil?", 'answer': "If you don't have any grease then you shouldn't be using the valve oil for the slides. But if you really don't have any grease and you really want to use it then you could use a paper clip to unclog the dispenser that the oil comes out of."}
