{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0002E50XG', 'answerTime': 'Oct 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414220400, 'question': 'whether this can be used for key boards to improve sound quality, for giving more punch etc.', 'answer': 'EQ can help with room acoustics and non-linear speakers. Since it affects ALL notes and voices of a keyboard, it is not a good voicing method. Suggest you shop for a keyboard that you like.'}
