{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0002E513U', 'answerTime': 'Sep 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411455600, 'question': "Connected to the CD player ok. I can't figure out how to connect to the FM radio on my receiver. Any detailed suggestions appreciated. Thanks!", 'answer': 'If your receiver is old enough, there may be a "tape monitor" switch on the front panel. Connect the record out to the eq inputs & the eq out to the tape inputs. With the tape monitor switch in the on position, it sends the preamp out to the eq & the eq out to the power amp section of the receiver.'}
