{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0002E4Z8M', 'answerTime': 'Dec 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418976000, 'question': 'Could this be used as a good mic for things like quality voice overs for YouTube videos and Lets Plays?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'There is no correct answer here. It\'s a question of taste. The SM7 is a typical "radio" mic, but can also be used as a voice over mic. There are some alternatives in the same price range that have more voice over characteristics, better frequency response and less noise in the signal. Still the SM7 is wonderful for radio (I own three of them) but it needs some extra tweaking with voice processing and EQ.'}
