{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0002E51PI', 'answerTime': 'Dec 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417420800, 'question': "I'm sold on the unit. Can somebody that is happy with the results suggest a replacement tube ? I was looking at the 12AY7EH Thanks", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Any 12AX7-A will work as well as 12AU7A,12AT7A,7025 and others.(output power will vary by tube number).You will have to decide based on whether you want a bass(low pitch) or more of a treble(Higher pitch) sound to suit your needs.I suggest you do some Google or Yahoo research to familiarize yourself with the variations of these tubes as well as the price difference as some of these like the 7025 and some types of the 12AX7-A can get expensive....'}
