{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0002F5BFW', 'answerTime': 'Nov 11, 2012', 'unixTime': 1352620800, 'question': 'Does this need a stand or anything? If I buy this product, do I need a stand?', 'answer': 'Yes, you need a stand so you can adjust the height and angle of the pad. If you are serious about drumming you should have a drummers throne also, so you get used to posture and position to the drum/pad.'}
