{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0002F5BFW', 'answerTime': 'Dec 18, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387353600, 'question': 'What is better? This or the Evans 2-Sided Practice Pad also 12 inches. Pros? Cons? Final thoughts?', 'answer': 'All I know is that we bought the Vic Firth 12" double sided for my daughter for her high school band practice and she still uses it for college. It\'s been a great product and we have no complaints.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0002F5BFW', 'answerTime': 'Aug 22, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377154800, 'question': 'What kind of a stand do I need? Can you lead me in the right direction of what type I need.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "A snare stand will work. You don't actually need any sort of stand. It can be placed on anything. If you like to sit and play, make sure you get a stand that will allow you to lower it low enough so you can sit and play comfortably. I don't know a ton about stands, sorry."}
