{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0002F6JH6', 'answerTime': 'Jan 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389859200, 'question': 'Do the middle bars get in the way when you use this stand in a sitting position?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It would depend on your sitting position and how far forward you have the keyboard on the first tier - the set back is about 8", depending on the height set. It\'s certainly no worse (and probably much better) than the cross pieces on one of the X-style portable stands.'}
