{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0002F77B8', 'answerTime': 'Mar 29, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427612400, 'question': 'will DR-212 fit in Epiphone dreadnought case that holds my DR-100?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I believe it should, but I would be careful. the dr 212 is a 12 string the Dr 100 is a 6 string. so your case may be a little bit too short. My 12 string measures 43" overall the body is 20" and the neck is 23" to the end of the top. Measure your case to be sure'}
