{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0002FOXD8', 'answerTime': 'Oct 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413529200, 'question': "the description says it only has 4 mic pre amps. but the XLR inputs for Ch 5/6 and for 7/8 say 'MIC'. will dynamic mics work on these last 2 inputs?", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Best Answer: There are six XLR inputs, meaning that, yes, you can connect six mics. But only the first four mic inputs have "pre amps," which I believe you\'ve confused mic inputs with pre amps, as these are two different things. Some mic inputs have pre amps and some do not. Simply put, a "pre amp" amplifies an XLR mic input signal. The purpose is to help increase the level of a weak/quiet mic.'}
