{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0002H068M', 'answerTime': 'Feb 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393401600, 'question': "Is it possible to plug this into a radio/dvd player in a van. We've had one that did and 1 that didn't work.", 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'I use this headset, and it has a 3 prong plug that connects to your audio equipment, which is typically going to be found on a professional piece of stereo equipment. I do not think you will have the right connection for a radio/dvd player. I use mine to teach spinning classes and it plugs into a mixer that has 5 channels.'}
