{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0002H0KG0', 'answerTime': 'Oct 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413874800, 'question': 'Does this come with decent strings? Or do i have to buy some separate?', 'answer': "A reviewer with more experience than I recommended new strings, and they were only $5, so I bought them. The strings that came with it sound OK. I would not buy an A style again. I know the A is cheaper, but the F style, with the horns that you can rest on your leg while you are playing, and that you can easily tie a strap to, is what real professionals use. I spend Half my time trying to balance the A style. It's like trying to balance a cup with a curved bottom. The body has pretty good workmanship for a $60 product. It's all wood."}
