{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0002H0QB4', 'answerTime': 'Feb 24, 2013', 'unixTime': 1361692800, 'question': 'Can i connect this DBX 231 pro eq to my home theatre receiver Marantz SR8500', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I would not recommend hooking up any EQ to any A/V Receiver. This could result in distortions in the signal processing features, ( ProLogic, Jazz, Concert,etc. ), of these modern receivers. This has the potential of damaging the high frequency speakers with some EQ settings. There is no problem using an EQ with a 2 channel receiver, if the EQ settings are not too extreme.'}
