{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0002HLL8G', 'answerTime': 'Mar 9, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425884400, 'question': 'What is the diameter of these pins just below the head? Would anybody be willing to check it with a pair of calipers?', 'answer': 'I dont know but i have them on a Seagull and an epiphone. They will fit about anything i guess. They do enhance the sound a lot but you will notice they are there if you rest your right hand on the bridge as I do, but now I dont even notice anymore. I would say get you a set cause they sound and look cool. I can pull mine out without plyers so thats cool too.'}
