{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0002M3OUO', 'answerTime': 'Jul 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406790000, 'question': 'Is the height of the 2nd tier adjustable?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No it is not. Only the angle of the second tier and the overall width is adjustable. This is a drawback of the design as the height and the depth are not adjustable. You could drill new holes for the mounts to lower the height and you can saw off the arms to shorten the depth, but that is not a fun task.'}
