{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0006DONOK', 'answerTime': 'Feb 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393401600, 'question': 'Can you drop it?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Don't know why you would want to, but I don't think these would stand up to much abuse. If you break the battery cap at the end of the unit, it would render it useless. Truthfully, I am not very satisfied with this product, it generates a lot of static noise. I have had similar units that looked identical I bought when I was in Hong Kong that were of much better quality. I would not recommend this product, I was quite disappointed with it."}
