{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0006GSEME', 'answerTime': 'Dec 29, 2013', 'unixTime': 1388304000, 'question': "I am considering this for a bass rig, but my Ampeg SVT-CL doesn't have an effects loop. Does this unit need to be in an effects loop to function?", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'The maxcom is best for vocals an controlling a mix which I use it for. You can use it for bass. Connect bass to MaxCom channel side line in 1 or 2 then to amp, if your running effects already make sure the maxcom is the last unit before amp. As a long time bassist if you have a compressor stick with that and go with the BBE 482 Sonic Maximizer to shape your sound that would be a better choice for bassist and guitarists.. Good Luck'}
