{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0006H92QK', 'answerTime': '18 days ago', 'question': "Since it doesn't come with a cable or stand, is there a specific type of cable and stand that I need? I need to plug it into an Audiobox Interface.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "The mic comes with a pretty decent mount which should fit most general mic stands. You could invest in a shockmount and a general mic stand. As for a cable, I would get a planet waves XLR cable. You can get any type of XLR but I just like planet waves, they are a great company that make good, sturdy cables. This is a good shockmount that should fit your mic http://www.amazon.com/Samson-Technologies-SP01-Spider-Shockmount/dp/B000LQLDM2 It's a great mic, enjoy it!!"}
