{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0006NDF8A', 'answerTime': 'Sep 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1378882800, 'question': 'Can this stand support a 1/2 size guittar?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes, this stand can hold up just about any guitar. I have both an electric bass and a regular acoustic guitar. The neck of the stand is adjustable depending on how high you'd want it or how long the neck of the guitar is. It supports both of my bass and guitar perfectly, so I'm more than sure it'll support a 1/2 sized guitar."}
