{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0006VYYGE', 'answerTime': 'Jan 25, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422172800, 'question': 'i have a epiphone les pail with stock 700t humbucker pickups. i play mostly rock. would these be better?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Most likely, no, simply because this is a cheaper humbucker and those stock ones are meant to be similar to gibsons Duncan's. However, this is based on opinion. My experience with this pickup was fairly good but the seymour Duncan's I have blow it out of the water. Dimarzios would produce a good sound for Rock. Being a guitar tech I would suggest you do a lot of research before you sink money into a pickup."}
