{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0006VYYFU', 'answerTime': 'Jul 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405494000, 'question': 'How good is this pick up from 1 to 10?', 'answer': "For the price? I would say 10. The thing is that you can't expect it to sound like an $80 Seymour Duncan or something like that. But if your looking to upgrade cheap stock pickups, like what comes in Epiphones, then this is a big improvement. Keep in mind that this has a ceramic magnet and is fairly high output, so some people my consider it to be harsh. this pickup will sound better for heavy metal and hard rock, then it will for blues or country"}
