{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0006ZXFWO', 'answerTime': 'Mar 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395817200, 'question': "how does this lock fit on to your guitar?....How does it 'lock' onto your guitar?", 'answer': "When you place it over your strap button after your strap, you twist the plastic piece to tighten or close the hole up over your button so it cannot slide off. They actually work very well and I would highly recommend to anyone. Especially to those who don't feel like altering their guitar and purchasing expensive strap lock style buttons. I'll be using these for all of my guitars that I use a strap with. I bought 3 sets and need to buy more."}
