{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0009GUOQA', 'answerTime': 'Feb 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392192000, 'question': 'Would this work for any application that requires phantom power?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I have not used this unit with anything requiring phantom power, but since this is technically an isolation transformer, I would anticipate that the phantom power supply would also be isolated between the input and output, and thus the phantom power would NOT pass through this unit.'}
