{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0009K5268', 'answerTime': 'Sep 22, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379833200, 'question': 'what is the difference in a "C" versus "F". I need it pitched for a female voice.', 'answer': 'Kathy - I sing with a Sweet Adelines chorus, and for most of us barbershoppers, the women usually use C to C pipes while the men usually use F to F pipes. Many in our chorus have this pocket tones C to C and find it very useful.'}
