{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0009K94L2', 'answerTime': 'Dec 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418198400, 'question': 'Would this be a good mic to use to record rapping/singing ?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'My experience is that it is a great recording mic. It was not meant for live performances as the design is sensitive to movement hence the rubber suspension holding mechanism to reduce vibrations. Good Luck.'}
