{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0009W0BDA', 'answerTime': 'Jan 10, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420876800, 'question': 'how/can i use this in a mono setup with my Harbinger PA system?', 'answer': "Hi James, I'm Jordan. First off I need to clarify which harbinger PA system you have, if it's the 60W or the 120W, I would use the main insert on the back of the mixer and connect a stereo 1/4 Inch Jack to split 1/4 mono jacks, then connect those to the left/mono input and output on the back of the lexicon. Hope that helps. Jordan"}
