{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000ATOFS4', 'answerTime': 'Jan 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389340800, 'question': 'Does it come with AC adapter? Or do I need to buy PSA-120S separately? Thanks!', 'answer': 'You will need to purchase a separate adapter. I saved some money by purchasing a Visual Sound Visual Sound One Spot Adapter available at http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0002GZLZQ/ref=oh_details_o06_s00_i01?ie=UTF8&psc=1. It has the correct electrical requirements.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000ATOFS4', 'answerTime': 'Nov 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415260800, 'question': 'Does this metronome have a function to start playing at one speed and have it gradually increase to another tempo?', 'answer': "I don't believe that that can be programmed unless it is somehow done through midi."}
