{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000CCN152', 'answerTime': 'Nov 20, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384934400, 'question': "Does anyone know if the unit 'wakes up' (after cycling the AC Mains power) in the last-used EQ / settings state, or if it defaults to present number zero upon power cycling?", 'answer': 'Mine re-starts with the same adjusted shut-down settings. If I tweaked a setting while in a earlier saved program, the tweak also returns after power-cycling. There\'s a clear to "pre-set\'s" function that returns mine to the earlier saved fixed program settings. I went with another unit and can\'t recall the menu/page. Their customer service was helpful.'}
