{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000CZ0R3S', 'answerTime': 'Nov 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1416643200, 'question': 'What is the difference in the SM57 &amp; the other one on amazon SM57-LC? Not sure what the LC is about on the other one', 'answer': 'It\'s the exact same mic. "LC" means "less cable". It was a package deal. There used to be an SM57-CN. That package included a cable. So, an SM57 and an SM57-LC are identical mics.'}
