{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000CZ0RLK', 'answerTime': 'Mar 7, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425715200, 'question': 'Can anyone recommend an inexpensive shock mount that would fit this mic? Thanks.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Not especially. I bought this mic, the clip broke and I have been unable to use it since without holding it. I Love Behringer products, but this is a really shoddily built mic. Id say save up a little more and get the Blu Yeti. 100x better quality and well built.'}
