{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000EEJGRK', 'answerTime': 'Dec 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418371200, 'question': 'does the hanger come off and base stay in place? i want to mount them to the sides of my stack but want to remove quickly to transport.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "All one piece....but I never used them because the mount did not appear strong enough to just hang on the wall. I was afraid I'd have falling vintage guitars so I opted out of these. The only other way I could use them was to mount a board over my wall and then mount them to the board. Hope this helps."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000EEJGRK', 'answerTime': 'Mar 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395298800, 'question': 'Would this hold a cello and if so, would you recommend it for that purpose?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Again...I would not use these to mount any of my guitars unless I did some type of reinforcement board behind the three screw mount. There is another type of hercules mount that looked sturdier but I ended up going an entirely different route on my guitars. I think you should google reviews for this particular mount by people who own instruments before you make this decision.'}
