{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000FUJ7KE', 'answerTime': 'Oct 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382338800, 'question': "I was just told by a saxophone professor that all new sax's leak &amp; will need to be adjusted. Will I need to get it adjusted after I receive the horn?", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Hey Alex, I lit a flashlight through the bell of the two L J Hutchen Alto Saxophones I purchased (in a dark room) and did not see any leaks. I would also recommend a Snark metronome for tuning before playing.'}
