{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000HAZ09Y', 'answerTime': 'Jun 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403938800, 'question': 'i might get this for christmas time for outsied wood it work on roof coverd buy a wooden box to keep it driy does it come with snow stuff', 'answer': "It will work, but a full tank of fluid only lasts about an hour or so on small flake. I do suggest a fan for extra lift for the flakes yo give a more accurate snow fall look. I suggest if you want want to get up on your roof a lot to just stick the tube into a gallon or larger sized fluid bottle or do not run it for long periods since you'll run out of fluid. The fkakes if I buy froggys frog extra dry stay around for a long time and cover the ground just fyi. Good idea to buy from froggys fog"}
