{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000HE7M3M', 'answerTime': 'Jan 19, 2011', 'unixTime': 1295424000, 'question': 'Does Xitel INport work on Mac OS X? Does anyone have experience with this product on a Mac?', 'answer': 'Ok everyone. The Xitel INport works fine with MAC. 1) You need to just plug in the INport. 2) Select it in your "system preferences &gt; sound &gt; input" the INport (if you don\'t see INport as an option then try plugging it in again, or restarting your mac) 3) Then install and audio recording app like "Audacity", and make sure that in this app\'s preferences that INport is selected. (note that if INport is not showing up or you don\'t see the volume levels reading audio from the input, you might need to restart your mac) Enjoy!'}
