{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000K69UM8', 'answerTime': 'Dec 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417680000, 'question': 'Does this pedal have a one-push stop button for the jammansolo xt', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Not really but you can go up or down with a blank channel and it will act like that but if you go back to the channel you were on it will still be on. It is mainly to change up or down to a different setting and change modes on the pedal. It works great for laying down back tracks for chorus and verses and be able to go back and forth and continue playing, works great as a one man band. I love it and use it for practicing for worship with the drums and added bass lines so it sounds more like it will with the full band or just to have fun playing with the other tracks.'}
