{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000KIPT30', 'answerTime': 'Dec 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418284800, 'question': 'I want to use this with the Zoom H6 Recorder. If all four channels are using headphones will all be able to hear the discussion over the headphones?', 'answer': 'I\'m slightly confused as to what you\'re asking. I\'m not familiar with the Zoom H6 Recorder, but I\'m assuming you\'re using this for podcasting based on you saying "discussion." The way this device works is that you connect it into the headphone port of the recording device. Any headphones connected to the Microamp will hear everything you\'re recording.'}
