{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000KITQKM', 'answerTime': 'Dec 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419148800, 'question': 'Does it work to record on pc without using the normal amplifier (A peavey 7w, too static noise for record)', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "No. I'm not sure what you have in mind but this is strictly a booster designed to raise the signal of a guitar or keyboard before going into an amp. It is not suitable for use in any recording chain."}
