{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000KN0BYM', 'answerTime': 'Oct 22, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382425200, 'question': 'How do you attach it to the ceiling? Does it come with colors?', 'answer': 'Hello, the motor has three screw holes that you can use to mount it to your ceiling. For best safety, make sure you are putting the screws into a beam or ceiling joist. The kit does not include color lenses. We do have them available for sale in several colors.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000KN0BYM', 'answerTime': 'Jul 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405926000, 'question': 'The description states "Includes a pinspot, 4 color gels...". However, a rep replying to a question states they do not...?', 'answer': 'When I ordered, it came with the pinspot and color gels. The color gels are really plastic caps that fit in front of the lamp. And they reduce the light a lot. If you are planning on using one of the darker colors, you will need to place the lamp very close to the ball. For example if you use the blue color, the lamp will need to be within 8ft of the ball.'}
