{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000KU87SM', 'answerTime': 'Nov 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415174400, 'question': 'Can I use this thru the TV?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes this would work but you will need to buy an additional cable. This cable will connect to your TV "Audio" out jacks via the RCA end and to the Behringer via the 1/4" end. The cable you need is a dual 1/4" to RCA. I will give you the part number I purchased. However, be aware you may want a longer cable which I am sure exist. I purchased a "Hosa" Cable PN: CPR202. This is a 1/4" to RCA cable 6.5 feet long. Hope this helps'}
