{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000KUCQXY', 'answerTime': 'Dec 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418371200, 'question': 'Does this serve the same purpose as the Behringer MX400 Micromix 4 Channel Line Mixer in a way if I can get the signal to be stereo? thanks', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "they are both mono input only units. the MA 400 mixes two mono sources (one mic level and one line level) to a stereo headphone out. the MX400 mixes 4 mono line sources to a mono line out; i do suppose you could run the left/right sides of stereo output into two separate inputs and combine to the mono output. is that what you're asking? and the ma400 boosts the signal enough to push a pair of headphones- so the purposes of the two units are very different."}
