{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000KW2YEI', 'answerTime': 'Dec 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417939200, 'question': 'I want to digitize reel to reel recordings and vinyl LP records. Will this work to input the sound to my laptop?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The inputs are line level - which means they will work for tape decks. The signal from record players (magnetic cartridge) is pretty low, so ou will need a preamp to get good results from a record player.'}
