{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000M3DZHA', 'answerTime': 'Feb 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393228800, 'question': 'Can anyone tell me how far this sticks out from the wall?', 'answer': 'It is about the same depth as your keyboard. When you place the keyboard on top of the stand, you can slide the two items up against the wall. Plan on the depth of your keyboard as the measurement of the distance from the wall.'}
