{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000N4WHYK', 'answerTime': 'Mar 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395126000, 'question': 'My bag arrived and I like it, however, is it only one should strap? Or two? Becasue there are two hooks, please advise, thanks.', 'answer': 'yes, it only has one strap, you can choose put it on either side as your preference. It is a crossbody strap, not like a backpack straps. I used it for a couple of time, is was not that good. I would rather use the handle. But I like the case, quality is good enough for my $200 guitar.'}
