{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000OMG0KI', 'answerTime': 'Dec 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417766400, 'question': "I know it won't fit perfectly, but can I use the humidipak for a tenor ukulele?", 'answer': "I would guess you could. Just don't let it get too dry. It gets hard when it's dried out and may make it difficult to pull out."}
