{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000OQI2CI', 'answerTime': 'Dec 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419235200, 'question': 'What is the best batt powered amp go with this guitar???', 'answer': 'Depends what you want it for. I bought a Roland MicroCube GX - an inexpensive 3W 5" speaker amp with lots of effects, runs off mains and batteries, is small and can be literally carried over one shoulder by a strap while the UltraLite is over the other. Not too ooud outside for busking or a party, great inside a room or small hall. There are lots out there but I\'m happy with the Roland. Good luck.'}
