{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000OR6HS8', 'answerTime': 'Jul 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405321200, 'question': 'Are these strings made in China or the USA?', 'answer': "Made in America.Each set of D'Addario strings has a a serial number/code and it specify that you can visit the company website to check if you suspect the strings are not authentic.It has further instruction for you to follow if it's not real.The company stated that it will replace it.Hope this helps."}
