{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000OY4WA6', 'answerTime': 'Sep 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379746800, 'question': 'any suggestions regarding microphone stands or wired microphones for use with this system?', 'answer': "You can mount this on a straight mic stand. Probably to heavy to raise up very high. I've put it up about waist high to use as a keyboard monitor on a small stage. The problem with using wired microphones is volume. It sounds great up to a point, and then distorts if it gets too loud. If you need volume much louder than a strong speaker or singer, this is probably not up to the job. My opinion, worth what you paid."}
