{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000QCON9Q', 'answerTime': 'Jun 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401692400, 'question': 'WILL THIS HEAD RUN 2 SETS OF 4ohm SPEAKERS ?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I wouldn't suggest it. There is just not enough power output here to run 2 - 4 ohm cabs. You need a bigger amp that can run bridge mono at 2 ohms if daisy chained or has separate outs for each cab with a higher wattage output. Of course this also depends on what the power handling and needs of each cab is. If its a bass cab then I'm betting its power needs are much higher than this amp can deliver. Call us we can help. Pro Audio Land 877-671-2200"}
