{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000V6E01I', 'answerTime': 'Dec 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1388044800, 'question': "Does any of the sellers ship to Canada if so what additional fees am I looking at? The amazon.ca doesn't have a wide selection", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'We can ship to Canada. The listing on Amazon will be charging standard internationl first class postal rate. This fee is auto with the listing done by stamps .com. To see the rates, order a unit, put it in the cart and go to check out. Just get to the last step to see rates. If the are too much for the items, go back and empty your cart. Look for our listings, we sell out very quickly at these low prices. Thank you for asking.'}
