{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000V8GA46', 'answerTime': 'Feb 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393401600, 'question': 'I was wondering before I make a purchase on buying the tascam digital recorder Do I need this device to work the machine???', 'answer': 'I bought the PSP520 to have unlimited power during our onstage orchestra performances which can be 4-6 hours long including rehearsals. My recorder [Tascam Dr100MKii], has a rechargeable Li-on battery [USB only to charge] and 2 AA batteries but that would still not be enough for our group except for short term recordings the Li-on is adequate.'}
