{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000V8GA46', 'answerTime': '25 days ago', 'question': 'Is this acuially a Tascam manufactured product? Please confirm that it is compatible with Tascam DR-2D', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It says that it is, but I don't know for sure. Anyways, I like the size of it. I enjoy the quality of the sound recording from the machine. The only thing I have against it, it is too complicated. I wish it was a little simpler to operate. I took me over two weeks to read the manual and try to figure out how to get it to work. I nearly gave up on it. I am still trying to understand the different tracks and how to switch from one to the other. So if anyone out there that would like to help me simplify the instructions, I would certainly appreciate it."}
