{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000VJZOLK', 'answerTime': 'Jan 4, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420358400, 'question': 'A question about guitar presets. I see there are many famous song guitar preset tones. Do the famous song presets include a backing track?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The artist presets are simply that - presets. There are backing tracks in another section of the amp, full backing tracks of songs plus drum beats.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000VJZOLK', 'answerTime': 'Aug 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408777200, 'question': 'Can you line out to a club pa with this amp?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It has a headphone out so I suppose you could send it to a PA. The signal out is low so it will need to be amplified for sure. I do believe its stereo there. It also has RCA stereo out in the back that also could be run into an amplified speaker such as a PA's."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000VJZOLK', 'answerTime': 'Nov 19, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384848000, 'question': 'I changed speaker with a larger magnet speaker, now amp is dead. Was it the speaker change or something else', 'answer': 'Speaker needs same ratings or it might damage unit or speaker . 4 ohm 8 ohm or 16 ohm and wattage ratings need to be within ratings for both , polarity also should be checked'}
