{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000VXKUL0', 'answerTime': 'Oct 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413529200, 'question': 'hi!...i need a switch that will allow me to connect 2 guitars to one amplifier input...essentially two guitars in with the capability to switch either of the two inputs to one output...will this footswitch do that?...or what would you recommend?...thanks!', 'answer': "Hello. The Hosa Dual-Channel switch won't accomplish that. It is designed for changing channels on an amplifier. What you are looking for is called and A-B-Y switcher which Amazon and music stores carry. I use one myself that is made by Morley and it works very well. I hope that helps!"}
