{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000W00X1Y', 'answerTime': 'Mar 8, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425801600, 'question': 'How to connect it on a full tube amp (to get a differente tone) ? Should it be connected on return (loop) or directly on guitar input ?', 'answer': 'The input. The effects loop usually has some pre amplification, often by op amp, which can water down the tube sound. Its certainly possible to put it in the loop, but you may push the VTM a little harder than they are designed to be, which can (under certain conditions) shorten life span.'}
