{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000WA8KYG', 'answerTime': 'Aug 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407135600, 'question': 'Will this work with a Blue Yeti condenser microphone?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Absolutely not. The Blue Yeti has a somewhat unique mounting system, which requires a specialized shock-mount 'ring'. This mount is designed to work with a large number of condenser style microphones with a screw-on back end. Blue makes the Radius shock-mount for this very purpose. I'm afraid that while the Yeti is a lovely microphone, you pay for the high-quality/low-cost in the form of incompatibility with most third party mounting options."}
