{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000WKY4C8', 'answerTime': 'Apr 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397286000, 'question': "Does any body use theses in master slave mode? I'm trying to use it as the master with a different dmx controlled dimmer as the slave", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Are you trying to get two dimmers to mirror each other? If so, just set them both to the same DMX address. Assuming of course, you are using a DMX controller, and not using the onboard "program" settings (this item will not work as a controller).'}
