{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000WY3HPO', 'answerTime': 'Jan 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388563200, 'question': 'How high is the string action? Would it be easy for a beginner to use?', 'answer': "Yes indeed it be easy to use. I'd suggest switching strings a couple months in. I did although not perfect it works, I think the gauge on them is 9 so I went with 9.5. It's really good for me and I just started learning in march. Plus I bought a fender mustang 1 amp, because the included amp does not have presets which make the guitar sound even better. It's a must for the price and you won't be disappointed. Hope this helped."}
