{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000XI6O2W', 'answerTime': 'Jan 4, 2013', 'unixTime': 1357286400, 'question': 'Will this work with the computer without a computer adapter?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Jeff nailed it- This is an analog microphone, size 6.35mm natively. The adapter included is a 6.35mm to 3.5mm, which is the same slot you would find on a pair of headphones or a computer microphone. The vast majority of computers have a 3.5mm microphone jack and this works fine with them. If you'd prefer to connect it to a USB, I use and recommend this adapter. http://www.amazon.com/Syba-SD-CM-UAUD-Adapter-C-Media-Chipset/dp/B001MSS6CS/ref=sr_1_2?ie=UTF8&qid=1357326994&sr=8-2&keywords=syba+sound+card"}
