{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000Y040ZC', 'answerTime': 'Nov 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383724800, 'question': 'What size violin does this fit?', 'answer': 'I have a full size violin. This gelrest is great. It is easy to remove and has enough sticky to be reapplies a couple times. It is more of a gel type adhesive so it does not leave any marks or residue. It may not fit your chin rest exactly because of the numberous chin rest shapes but it works great.'}
