{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001032IDS', 'answerTime': 'Aug 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409295600, 'question': 'Could the Phantom Power from the mixer damage this box? I need to activate it on my mixer since I also have some condenser mics.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It depends on the amperage coming down the wire. Phantom Power is insufficient to drive the box, but anything above 16VDC will damage the unit. You can run condenser mics through the unit, so if you board is not pushing in excess of 16VDC you should be good. http://www.rolls.com/pdf/M_PM351.pdf'}
