{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00113ZULE', 'answerTime': 'Jan 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389600000, 'question': 'how do set my settings on Tascam dp02 for recording vocals over instrumentals?', 'answer': 'Like a Karaoke? You can input Instrumentals or Instrument as a Play Back, and just select which of the 8 channels you want to record. You can first record only one instrument, and record other channel while you arte listen the instrument recorded before. You can repeat this procedure several times up to obtain the best results. When finished your creation, you have to Masteries it in order to have an optimum result.'}
