{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0012754UG', 'answerTime': 'Oct 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382857200, 'question': 'Is the Olympus LS-14 the newer version of the Ls-10, and if so, why is the LS-10 so expensive?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It appears to be just the newer version. My LS10 still works like a champ so I really haven't been looking at an upgrade. It look like the LS14 has a lot of new features, ergo, etc... Good luck."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0012754UG', 'answerTime': 'Oct 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382338800, 'question': "I'm thinking of using this digital voice recorder as a 'black box' for my person. Does the included pouch fit on a belt and is the device durable?", 'answer': 'The pouch does not have a belt loop, and it is just a cloth material pouch. I carry it in a brief case and put it in one of those inexpensive plastic pencil cases. If you are planning to turn it on while it is on your belt as "black box" recorder, then there is the risk you will accidentally bump the off button. It has been a good product and I am very satisfied with it, but I don\'t really like the passive device to record telephone calls as it gets uncomfortable in your ear on long phone calls. I also recommend purchasing the electric adapter as hand held devices do seem to suck up a lot of battery power.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0012AUHXW', 'answerTime': 'Jan 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389859200, 'question': 'Does this work with Windows 8.1?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "This microphone works perfectly with Win. 8.1. That is what I run on my gaming rig, and this mic gives perfect voice quality to my YouTube videos. I don't think this mic really cares about your OS, since it has no drivers to install. It's just plug and play!"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0012AUHXW', 'answerTime': 'Apr 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396940400, 'question': 'Is the mic sensitive enough where I can keep it about 4 ft from me to be heard or must I speak right into it', 'answer': 'Yes, it can be placed on a desk for dictation. For superior recording quality, speak clearly and have suitable sound-absorbing material stop sound from bouncing around your recording space.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0012AUHXW', 'answerTime': 'Aug 28, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377673200, 'question': 'how long is the cord?', 'answer': "The actual output is a Mini-A USB plug. The Blues comes with a 1-meter Mini-A to Type A cable which fits nicely in the case. If you need a longer cable, they're pretty cheap."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0012AUHXW', 'answerTime': 'Oct 24, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382598000, 'question': 'has anyone tried recording music (vocals or instrumentals) with this mic?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I've used this mic for a podcast, and it handles a speaking voice just fine. For instrumentals, I've had more success with the Blue Yeti."}
