{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0015YM828', 'answerTime': 'Aug 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407913200, 'question': 'how nice is the noise gate of this NS? beacuse i will use the highest gain that this thing could offer, or you recommend me a noise suppressor pedal?', 'answer': "The suppression works well on the unit, just takes some time to fine tune it. If you're going to run an OD through the front I strongly suggest just getting a Decimator for convenience and no headaches. I really love my Nova in the effects loop, and only like it when it's ran through the front. It's worth every penny man. Just don't get over whelmed, there is one heck of a learning curve."}
