{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00160PRBU', 'answerTime': 'May 17, 2013', 'unixTime': 1368774000, 'question': 'IS this suppose to be the XLR or USB version?', 'answer': "This is the XLR version (as Matthew pointed out, the USB version says it in the title). I haven't had any problems of hissing or background noise with this mic, the internal noise of the mic is actually superb. In Matthew's case, maybe it could be a defective mic (that should be exchanged under warranty), or a poor quality or damaged pre-amp, which is often the case."}
