{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0016MJ1T2', 'answerTime': 'Oct 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414738800, 'question': 'what is the warrenty on a beheringer 600 box?', 'answer': 'It is a standard parts and labor warranty, you must send the unit back to an authorized repair shop or to Behringer. I thought mine was a 1 year warranty. These units are so inexpensive that sending it away to be fixed would be a poor use of resources. Not to mention it being gone for a long time. Now, if you purchase it at a retail outlet they may have a different arrangement. I bought mine through Amazon. Mine is still working fine.'}
