{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00175RNR0', 'answerTime': 'Feb 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393142400, 'question': 'Will this throne be suitable for a 10 year-old boy, and is it easy for him to adjust height of seat? Thanks for your help. nanalorry', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Depends on how tall he is. It's a very comfortable seat that's very thick which might make it a little big for him. Of course he could grow into it. It's very easy to adjust the height of it. Hope this helps! -Kyle"}
