{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00186JFW4', 'answerTime': 'Jul 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405148400, 'question': 'Can you plug this into a car?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes, but it's impractical. You'll need to get a power inverter, plug it into the cigarette lighter, and your car needs to be running. You're better off just using NiMH batteries and having two sets of them. This amp will run a LONG time on a set of batteries though. Some people have reported getting as much as 20 hours. -TJ"}
