{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001A5G9V8', 'answerTime': 'Dec 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418889600, 'question': 'i have a 12 cords guitar which better narrow or wide format', 'answer': 'The important thing to consider is the thickness of your saddle. If your saddle is 3/32" (2.4 mm) thick, you need the narrow pick-up. If your saddle is 1/8" (3.2 mm) thick, you need the wide saddle'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001A5G9V8', 'answerTime': 'Apr 2, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427958000, 'question': 'Will this pickup work well with Luna safari series 3/4 size? If yes,then narrow or wide?', 'answer': "You will have to measure the thickness of saddle on your bridge, it's either 1/8 or 3/32nd.. If you don't know, take it to your guitar store they can measure it or Google the guitar specs and that should tell which one to order..&#128076;"}
