{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001AEA0G4', 'answerTime': 'Feb 4, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423036800, 'question': "Will a danelectro '59 type guitar fit in one of these?", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "The Danelectro '59 is a semi hollow guitar but the body isn't as wide as a Gibson 335. It will fit but on the widest part of the guitar, is not wide enough to fill the whole compartment. Too much open space and the guitar will be bouncing up and down while you walk or during transportation. I won't recommend it."}
