{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001BYW3KY', 'answerTime': 'Oct 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412492400, 'question': 'what does the steam machine come with?', 'answer': "It comes with the machine (of course) with the attached hose, an attachment for corners and a brush attachment for furniture. So, it's basically everything you need in a basic steam cleaner for your floors and furniture. It actually does work well and I'm happy with how it cleans."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001BYW3KY', 'answerTime': 'Sep 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411196400, 'question': 'Where is the clean water tank?', 'answer': 'The clean water and dirty water are part of same container.. the dirty water pulls the clean water and there is no possible way for the water to mix. The whole piece is about the weight of a gallon of milk. It is obvious when you need to get fresh water, it makes a difference in sound..'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001BYW3KY', 'answerTime': 'Sep 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410159600, 'question': 'When cleaning carpet I know you add water but where does dirty water go when cleaning carpet?', 'answer': 'This machine has a two part chamber. you fill one part with the cleaning fluid and water, the dirty water drains in the separated chamber. Makes using the machine easier and more efficient to use.'}
