{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001EA3TDK', 'answerTime': 'Feb 21, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424505600, 'question': 'brand new Obey 40 not working with new intimidator. Plug in, irregular response. Cannot repeat actions - defective unit?', 'answer': "From my experience, the DMX protocol isn't 'plug and play'. I had to spend some serious time finding out what channels do what to the fixture. It could well be you have a defective unit, but before returning it I'd do a search and see if there is anyone who's posted about your setup and see if that gives you more info. Hope this helps."}
