{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001EO4DAO', 'answerTime': 'Jul 13, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373698800, 'question': 'What kind of Microphone work with this Product? I have the Behringer C-1 Microphone which is not working. I just got it two days ago. Please help.', 'answer': 'The Behringer C-1 is a condensor microphone. It requires what is called phantom power. This is where the device it is plugged into provides 48 volts DC to power the microphone. The mixer does not provide phantom power. You can use an external power supply for the mic which would plug inline between the mic and the mixer.'}
