{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001FSJC2I', 'answerTime': 'Nov 13, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384329600, 'question': 'Is this keyboard weighted, or is it just touch sensitive ?', 'answer': 'The keys are light feeling and probably not weighted, but you can open the "FUNCTION" menu and there is a "TOUCH" option: "OFF", "1" and "2". "2" is the highest/most sensitive setting and makes it feel more like a real piano. I turn the touch response to "OFF" when I am using the keyboard for midi or recording. The touch response is quite nice. The velocity/volume of the note depends on how FAST you hit the key, not how HARD you hit the key. The keys do feel pretty light to be honest though. But this alone should not deter you from buying the keyboard.'}
