{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001G7F7F4', 'answerTime': 'Dec 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386835200, 'question': 'product description says it will process guitar or keyboard. is this true? some reviews indicate this may not be the case for guitar. thanks,.', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'The VoiceTone Harmony M has 2 inputs, one XLR and one MIDI. There are no 1/4" inputs typically used for guitar. It was designed for keyboard and voice. If you have an XLR or MIDI output on your guitar it may work, although I have not tried it. TC-Helicon makes another processor unit specifically for guitar.'}
