{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001HKSWK2', 'answerTime': 'Sep 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411455600, 'question': 'Is it possible to plug my Samson 510i powered mixer in this powered subwoofer, or will that really mess it up?', 'answer': 'You cannot send a hot signal into the speaker. If you have an aux out for a stereo signal, that will work just fine.... but no power lines going to the speakers!!'}
