{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001HXII80', 'answerTime': 'Sep 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1378450800, 'question': 'I understand that ACID PRO is a recording music editor.Can I use this like a music equalizer so I can make adjustments to listen to music perfectly', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Acid Pro 7 is a music creation program primarily. Using it as an EQ would be overkill. Youre better off buying a physical EQ console.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001HXII80', 'answerTime': 'Jan 8, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420704000, 'question': "How do I install the included plugins if I downloaded ACID and I don't have a DVD distribution?", 'answer': 'Assuming that you have registered your software (under the help menu) 1 - Open into Sony Acid. 2 - Go to the help menu at the top of interface. 3 - Click on FL Studio Homepage. 4 - Log in. 5 - Click My Account. 6 - My Licenses. This is where you can download your content.'}
