{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001HXII80', 'answerTime': 'Feb 3, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422950400, 'question': 'Does this include software to clean/scrub audio from 4-channel records or tapes?', 'answer': 'Do you mean, just take previous recordings and process the sound for better fidelity (via EQ\'s, noise reduction, etc.)? Not sure what you mean by "clean/scrub audio" but this is a full DAW with multi-track recording, editing, mixing, arranging and producing. It includes Midi in/out and can host a multitude of plug ins. It also comes with it it\'s own suite of plugins for effects, EQ, etc. It is a full workstation. If all you want to do is process audio, I would look at something like SoundForge or another simple audio editor'}
