{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001JJB2GM', 'answerTime': 'Oct 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413615600, 'question': "Recommend Monster Pro 2500 or this for my Presonus digital 16.4.2AI mixer, MacBook, (3) Sennheiser IEM's (4) Shure wireless..", 'answer': "Furman's are really nice working with sound equipment. I use one on my personal stereo gear and one on my PA (including wireless) Bigest advantage is noise suppression and also getting all devices running at the same level on the same clock. Pretty affordable for everything it provides You will realize a maximization of frequency range. Herbert Bicknell Hardy Socio Muiscoligist Michigan"}
