{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001JJB2GM', 'answerTime': 'Sep 8, 2013', 'unixTime': 1378623600, 'question': 'can I use this device to charge up my computer stuff just by plugging into the usb charger and then to electrical outlet?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yeah. This device is exactly like a old school power strip. The difference is it gives clean, protected power. They are specially circuited to provide even, low noise, "conditioned" power. Better applications would be for sound equipment as you are more concerned with "clean" power in this scenario. But certianly works like any other power strip as far as what you can plug into it'}
