{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001PB3VUY', 'answerTime': 'Oct 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413529200, 'question': 'Forgive me if this has already been mentioned, but does this unit have EQ? and if so what kind and how customizable is it?', 'answer': "Every amp preset has the same tone control complement you would find on the actual amp, and when connected to a computer, you can access the parametric EQ for each preset. This EQ works separately from the amp tone controls. You access the amp's tone controls by opening the preset on the unit directly or in the computer software interface. I'd advise going to DigiTech's website and download the manual. It will tell you everything you need to know. The available control parameters are very broad!"}
