{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001PGXKC8', 'answerTime': 'Jun 3, 2013', 'unixTime': 1370242800, 'question': 'are these necessary to use boss-dd7 ?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'Im not sure i understand your question. You need two cables for any single pedal. One from the pedal to the guitar, and one from the pedal to the amp. These short jumper cables can be used inbetween pedals when your running more than one pedal.'}
