{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001Q9EE4W', 'answerTime': 'Feb 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392710400, 'question': 'Does it come set up and ready to play? (Aside from tuning)', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I ultimately bought this very banjo from a local shop rather than through Amazon. My guess would be that it's not perfectly in tune out of the box. Banjos being wood instruments fluctuate with temperature and frequently go out of tune even in the course of playing them. Watch a professional banjo player and watch them tune their instrument in the middle of a show when no one else has to. Otherwise there is nothing to put together."}
