{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001RNZQH6', 'answerTime': 'Jan 24, 2013', 'unixTime': 1359014400, 'question': 'Ipurchased this product and did all of my down loads and up dates, my problem is, I am not getting an output from my computer, can anyone help me with', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Open Maschine, go up to 'File', 'Audio and MIDI Settings...' under device choose 'built-in' if you want it to come thru you computers internal speakers of headphone out. If you have an interface plugged in that should also show up under devices."}
