{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001RNZQH6', 'answerTime': 'Oct 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382857200, 'question': 'Does the maschine thats priced at 249.95 come with the software', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I haven't seen a Maschine Mk1 at that price so I would check the details. If you're buying a Maschine new, then yes up to 1.8 should be free but you'll definitely have to pay for the upcoming 2.0 software. If you're buying a used Maschine then you need to verify that previous owner canceled their license from Native Instruments so that you can register the software and license."}
