{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001RRJ1AK', 'answerTime': 'Jan 17, 2015', 'unixTime': 1421481600, 'question': 'What kind of a connection is needed for the body pack if I want to purchase a different headset?', 'answer': 'The body jack will take a standard 3.5mm jack from any mic manufacturer. It comes with a threaded 3.5mm mic but other companies make those as well. In my experience the threaded ones work better because they stay in place when the mic is used on someone who moves a lot. But both work.'}
