{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001T9O5VG', 'answerTime': 'Mar 26, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427353200, 'question': 'Can I use this to multi-track? For example, can my buddies and I all play at the same time and have our instruments record onto different tracks?', 'answer': 'You should definitely be able to, keep in mind there are four tracks, all of which have 1/4 stereo jacks, but only two have XLR inputs.'}
