{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001U0OWSU', 'answerTime': 'Jan 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390377600, 'question': 'Does this guitar have a steel reinforced neck?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "No, most nylon string guitars do not use a truss rod in the neck and the HC06 is no exeption. You can put nylon strings on a steel string guitar, but you can't put steel strings on a nylon string guitar because the construction is lighter. You can warp or twist a nylon string neck if using incorrect stringing methods."}
