{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001XWD3LC', 'answerTime': 'Mar 15, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426402800, 'question': 'Is it ok to daisy chain a passive 15" speaker to a 12"speaker (8 ohms) for mains, I realize the split in ohms when doing this but is it kosher??', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes, that is OK. Just make sure to not over power them. Remember, the total power in will be divided in HALF, going to each speaker, so even if the 15" speaker can handle more, the total max power output of your amp shouldn\'t exceed twice the rating of the 12" speaker.'}
