{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0027842S4', 'answerTime': 'Nov 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1416729600, 'question': 'To what extent does this stand come apart and fold up? (HoW transportable is it?)', 'answer': "It's in 3 pieces- top, neck and bottom stand. It comes apart in about 10 seconds. It's pretty easy to transport, but it's a bit heavy/bulky. I don't know that I'd want to transport it back and forth daily, but once per week would be fine. The portable ones (we also have one) don't hold sheet music well and are not near as sturdy. Our portable (open one) fell over constantly, so that's why we bought this durable one. I love this conductor stand as do my kids (9 and 10)."}
