{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0028SPFFC', 'answerTime': 'Mar 17, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426575600, 'question': 'how do you add reverb?', 'answer': 'My suggestion is to use an external mixer with reverb and come out of mixer into input on the Bose L1 Compact. There is no internal reverb or any way to add it. A reasonable priced one a 4 channel mixer for $89 is Behringer Eurorack UB1002FX 4-Channel Mixer. If you have a mixer already just come out of the line out and run a line cable to the Bose L1 and switch it to line input instead of instrument.'}
