{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002BFDOC8', 'answerTime': 'Apr 17, 2015', 'unixTime': 1429254000, 'question': 'Will the software let me go old-school and put notes on a music staff for the keyboard to play? Can I print sheet music that I create?', 'answer': 'The software for this keyboard is only for MIDI mapping, not for recording or scoring. It sounds like you are looking for Sibelius or Finale or something like that. This keyboard can be used with those programs, but you will need to buy the software separately.'}
