{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002BSHA48', 'answerTime': 'Mar 21, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426921200, 'question': "how do I know which frequency I need? I teach dance and my students need to hear me when the music's on (separate system)", 'answer': 'If you have no other wireless equipment, then whatever you get should work fine. The only situation that could be a problem is if there is other wireless audio equipment in the building on the same channel.'}
