{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002C4OUMQ', 'answerTime': 'Aug 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407308400, 'question': 'will this fogger fill a large football tunnel', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I'm almost certain that it will! Use a high density fog fluid though. On a calm night I had this machine fill up a 1 acre piece of land. I'm not exaggerating either.. The fog stayed in the air for a while and eventually settled. My yard looked haunted. Eventually it started drifting into the neighbors yards. Very powerful machine"}
