{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002C4SM5W', 'answerTime': 'Dec 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418457600, 'question': 'This is a stupid question, but why is it "Five-Piece" when I see at least 8 pieces in the picture?', 'answer': "It is 5 piece. The drums are what is counted with Alesis. The 2 cymbals and 1 high hat are included but don't count in the 5 piece description. This is a great set for this price. Spending 2 times more for a Yamaha or other makes no sense."}
