{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002C741B8', 'answerTime': 'Sep 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411628400, 'question': 'Does this make noise when off the guitar? I just purchased and it is not making any noise when attached to my guitar or when I tap the transducer part', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, by just tapping it, with the amp turned on, and not attached to your instrument you should be able to hear the tapping. Make sure that you have plugged it into the INPUT of the amp not the output. This transducer is very sensitive and any sounds will definitely be noticed when attached to an amp.'}
