{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002CWQTXG', 'answerTime': 'Mar 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394607600, 'question': 'I live in Michigan and I have no idea which one of these to buy. A, B or G band?', 'answer': 'Sennheiser has a frequency location service on their website. (http://en-us.sennheiser.com/service-support-frequency-finder) A B and G are separate frequency ranges If you choose the wrong one for your location you have a chance of getting UHF interference from local TV broadcasts.'}
