{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002FKBHHS', 'answerTime': 'Oct 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412578800, 'question': 'Will this fit the Machine Studio and a Macbook Pro', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I own a few of these exact and they fit my large HP ENVY 17" laptops which are bigger than any MacBook 15" or 17" laptops. They are built very nice and look great. Being that the machine studio is 2.3 inches thick you should be able to fit both. Alternatively you could look into a waterproof hard case like pelican or seashore cases. Good luck! Hope that helps!'}
