{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002FPQ8CW', 'answerTime': 'Sep 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379142000, 'question': "I have arthritis and can't do screws very well. What are these? If levers, are they easier than screws for arthritic hands?", 'answer': 'This stand is very sturdy and the screws have knobs that are not too tiny. I returned it only because for me it took longer to set up than the ones with levers. But the stand is well-built. The screws are not tiny and have nice handles so it might not be worse than some stands with very tight levers. Good luck!'}
