{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002GRBA2M', 'answerTime': 'Sep 30, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380524400, 'question': 'Can it hook into an iPad and iPhone?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No. It can NOT directly connect to an iPhone. The jacks are the same diameter and it will physically fit but but iPhones use a TRRS plug this mic has a "normal" TRS. You can buy adaptors. Ignore the comment here about "XLR". This mic is not an XLR mic.'}
