{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002GYWBIM', 'answerTime': 'Apr 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397286000, 'question': 'Is it possible with the Line 6 Spider IV 15 15-watt (or higher model) to get a clean jazzy sound using a strat or tele type guitar?', 'answer': 'Yes, but you\'ll need to reprogram one of the amp\'s channel presets (preferably Clean) to get what you want. Select the Clean channel, adjust the Drive and Tone controls to get the sound you like (the default Clean channel preset still has some "dirt" in it), then (important!) press and hold the Clean amp model button on the amp for two seconds. This replaces the built in Clean model with your custom settings.'}
