{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002GYWBKK', 'answerTime': 'Nov 3, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383462000, 'question': 'I am primarily interested in getting this to control the looper in my SpiderJam amp. Can anyone comment on its ease of use/effectivness?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "While I don't have a SpiderJam specifically I do own the Line 6 Shortboard MKII (in my case for a spider IV 75) and it works great. I can control everything with my feet that I could with my hands (minus the EQ) and also add the expression pedal which can be used as either a volume or Wah pedal. Some factory presets in the amp also use the effects pedal for other things. Definitely worth the price in my opinion."}
