{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002IPHFXU', 'answerTime': 'Jun 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401778800, 'question': 'DOES THIS UNIT COME WITH DUAL MIC. CONTROLS', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'It does but one of them did not work on the first unit I bought so I returned it within the 30-day return window. I the second unit I got always had problems reading the CD and one day it simply stopped working. It was still under warranty so I thought I would be OK, but Emerson refused to fix it simply saying: "The GM527 was discontinued last year and no replacement or repair options exist for that unit. kevin" Nobody answered any of my emails after that. This company does not stand behind their warranty so don\'t buy from them. Also, the actual website for dealing with complains, returns, warranties, etc., was VERY hard to find.'}
