{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002KDHBRU', 'answerTime': 'Nov 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415260800, 'question': 'Where do I get replacement batteries?', 'answer': "Hi Anne, these are CR2032 batteries which are stocked at most drug stores. Much cheaper if you can wait for them to be shipped is to get them through Amazon - just search on CR2032. I bought these: http://www.amazon.com/Maxell-CR2032-lithium-batteries--pack/dp/B006GDL0FY/ref=sr_1_4?s=hpc&ie=UTF8&qid=1415331282&sr=1-4&keywords=cr2032 Good luck, it's a great tuner!"}
