{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002LNBG1Q', 'answerTime': 'Dec 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419148800, 'question': 'Can you record your music on here and then upload it to your computer? Also do you need any computer software to use this? Thanks in advance:D', 'answer': "This a Midi controller. This is designed specifically for computer use and will only work when connected to a DAW. I currently use FL Studio with it right now. It is great but my only problem is when I plug it in and activate it with my DAW the pads are not correspondent with the pad on the computer. I have to resync it everytime I open up the plugin. Other than that particular problem the AKAI MPD18 is fine. You have to record the sounds live by using the recorder while the metronome is playing usually, unless you're just that good that you can consistently crank out the exact same bpm every time"}
