{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002OSWGLM', 'answerTime': 'Mar 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1364367600, 'question': 'Will this cart work with a Pyle PLTTB3U TT? How do I know what carts will work with it? (TT novice)', 'answer': 'Your major concern should be with the effective mass of the tonearm. I believe the Pyle has a mid- to high-mass tonearm, so you would not want to mate it to a high-compliance cartridge. The CN5625AL should work just fine with it.'}
