{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002OV87YY', 'answerTime': 'Nov 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415692800, 'question': 'How many headsets can this support? Could we get additional remote packs and send the mix to all 5 people in our band?', 'answer': 'This supports one. You need a transmitter for every person and a reliever for every person. There may be another model that supports more than one. This one does not. The only way to get a feed from this to multiple people (however, they would all have the same Mix and would be hard wired, is to run the headphone out to a headphone amplifier/splitter. You would still be able to have one wireless pack and the rest hard wired.'}
