{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002PAW6EG', 'answerTime': 'Jun 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402038000, 'question': 'Will this connect on the top to a standard tripod mount ? What is the threading on the top side of the stand? I am looking for 5/8"-27', 'answer': "It will not connect to a tripod. There is no threading. You simply slide a microphone in the sleeve. It's a tight fit for the microphone we use. The base is heavy and stays put well, but the top leaves much to be desire."}
