{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002PHVAQY', 'answerTime': 'Sep 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411110000, 'question': 'Can you plug external mini speakers into the headphone jack and get a decent sound?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'You can certainly plug in mini speakers - though how decent the sound is depends on the quality of the speakers you use. I use it as a preamp for recording in Garage Band and it sounds great. I also use it as an overdrive/preamp with my practice amp. That has a 10 inch speaker and sounds fantastic. Through mini speakers you will certainly get a good sound - but as mentioned it depends on how good they are to begin with.'}
