{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002PHVAQY', 'answerTime': 'Aug 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407913200, 'question': 'I have one that works ok, except that there is a loud buzzing sound in my headphones when I use it. Is that normal? How do I prevent it?', 'answer': 'Seems like it might be a flaky ground connection. If you\'ve tried other headphones, and if you don\'t get a buzz when you plug your guitar into another amp, I\'d guess that the AmPlug has a faulty ground connection inside, most likely at the 1/4" phone plug.'}
