{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002QJVTNA', 'answerTime': 'Mar 23, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427094000, 'question': 'Do you have a shoulder rest for 3/4 size?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The shoulder rest comes in two sizes, 1/2 to 3/4 and 3/4 to 4/4. The shoulder rest is designed to be flexible and can be slightly adjusted to fit your specific size. I would recommend getting the 3/4 to 4/4 size so you can keep using it when you move to a larger size violin. This item is decribed as the Everest 4A Violin Shoulder Rest (3/4 - 4/4). I hope that helps'}
