{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002SAOAL0', 'answerTime': 'May 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399359600, 'question': 'Would this be small enough for a carry on bag for flying?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'It depends on how long your bag is. This is an amazing stand i.e. light, strong, great case, etc.; but it is long when folded up. Check the length with your luggage, and if it fits, you will be happy with this stand. Another great feature is that it extends without coming apart so if you stand for a solo, you just pull up and its set.'}
