{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002T45X1G', 'answerTime': 'Mar 4, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425456000, 'question': 'Looking for a good mic on a budget for miking drums, in a 2-mic set up. Will this do well as a compliment to good kick mic?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It'll probably do it well, but in my opinion you would have better results using the ORTF (2 mics overhead) setup in addition to the Kick mic. A good and inexpensive ORTF combo: Superlux S502"}
