{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002T45X1G', 'answerTime': 'Dec 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417766400, 'question': 'Is the final price of $ 218 includes customs clearance, shipping and home delivery in Egypt? Is there any other expenses to receive the product in Egy', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Usually if you ship items no matter what outside of the U.S. you could be subject to your own countries customs, this is out of control of really any shipper. Does not mean you will have them just be aware that it is a likely scenario.'}
