{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002VYJDYW', 'answerTime': 'Mar 5, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425542400, 'question': 'I notice the transport control buttons (play, stop, record, etc.) are also listed with the midi control values underneath. can they be mapped too?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes, the transport buttons are re-assignable. I confirmed it with the owner's manual (page 3). The manual also contains extensive instructions on remapping any of the controls on the controller (e.g. reversing the direction of the slider, limiting the amount of travel, increment/decrement functions, etc)."}
