{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002WMURBQ', 'answerTime': 'Apr 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398236400, 'question': 'What is the difference between this guitar and the Danelectro \'59 "O" model? Because I\'ve seen it in blue, red, etc', 'answer': 'Other than this guitar only coming in black, the main difference is the bridge. This guitar is based on the so called Jimmy Page mod, and has the Leo Quan "Badass" bridge that he put on his DC59 in the early 80\'s.'}
