{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0035JI8J8', 'answerTime': 'Oct 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413442800, 'question': 'Can you customize the individual effects? For example the dry/wet mix? or change the speed for effects like tremolo?', 'answer': 'Hi Elisandro, of course you can. Just choose the effect with the memory pedals, then press write and exit buttons to edit. Now you can adjust the effect as desired by choosing the category you want (sound library buttons), and adjusting knobs to get the different variations. I hope it helps you.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0035JI8J8', 'answerTime': '22 days ago', 'question': 'Im new in this, so, i need to know some things about this, can i set: distortion chorus and reverb and use the right pedal as a wah?(just for example)', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Absolutely! You are able to set this pedal out in many ways, select pre amps, compresion, reverb, delay, chorus, phazer, flanger and other effects, mix them and create your own sound, you can emulate an acoustic guitar sound (which isnt so good really but...), the pedal could work as volume, wah, frezze and other function I dont remember now. I can tell you this is great pedal, the only thing you have to do is explore its. Regards.'}
