{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0035JI8J8', 'answerTime': 'Sep 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380092400, 'question': 'Can you stack modulation effects with this pedal or is it one at a time?', 'answer': 'Mods are one at a time, but you can stack mods with overdrives and wah effects. Best way to stack is with individual pedals.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0035JI8J8', 'answerTime': 'Feb 27, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425024000, 'question': 'Can you select the order of the effects with this device? For example: compression, then overdrive, then modulation, then reverb/delay?', 'answer': "I don't think so. Chains are pre-defined and the order of the effects is hardcoded. I couldn't find a decent PDF of the manual online, but there's a nice scheme in it. Truth is I never needed to do that and I trust the usual stacking of effects. Your mileage may vary."}
