{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00371R8PO', 'answerTime': 'Oct 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382770800, 'question': 'What type of USB cable do I need to hook this up to my laptop?', 'answer': 'All you need to do is install the drivers and use a "usb A to usb B cable".'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00371R8PO', 'answerTime': 'Jan 13, 2013', 'unixTime': 1358064000, 'question': 'The console works with Windows 7? Can I to record or save my own mixes like mp3 files in my computer?', 'answer': "Yes it works with Windows 7. It is just a hardware controller for DJ software so depending on what software you use it to control you can record your own mixes. It comes with a dumbed down version of virtual DJ which I don't believe gives you the option to record but if you can get your hands on the full version then you are golden."}
