{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0039PPW60', 'answerTime': 'Apr 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396508400, 'question': "I am going to purchase three (Audio-Technica AT2020 USB Condenser USB Microphone) mics. Will these plug into this mixer? Sorry I'm brand new at this.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'No, they won\'t plug into this in the way *I think* you want them to. There\'s a USB port on the back of this, but it\'s for interfacing with a computer, not for plugging USB microphones into it. Side note: I have an AT2020 USB, and I like it... but to use this mixing board with three AT2020s, you would need the XLR-type interface AT2020 mic, not the USB type. (Search for "AT2020 side address" on Amazon.)'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0039PPW60', 'answerTime': 'Dec 30, 2013', 'unixTime': 1388390400, 'question': 'Does it come wih effects? Is it good?', 'answer': "Not sure what responders are talking about here. The X1204USB does indeed built in FX but the 1204USB model doesn't (and is $30 cheaper).. Just look at the top right of the board where it lists all the preset effects... reverb, chorus, delay, etc..."}
