{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003AYLP9S', 'answerTime': 'Mar 3, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425369600, 'question': 'Can you use the Multi-Media 2-Teir Shelf for the R2?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'According to the Rock n Roller website, the Media Shelf is designed to fit the R8; R10; R12 models. The photo of the R2 model shows that the uprights on each end are not equal in height, (unlike the R8,R10,R12)-- and the overall base dimensions of the R2 are substantially smaller than the R8; R10; R12 models for which the shelf is recommended. I do not believe that the Media Shelf would fit on the R2, even with modification.'}
