{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003B12LK2', 'answerTime': 'Mar 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395990000, 'question': 'what is the head made of?', 'answer': "It looks like some sort of animal hide, it can fade from dense to clear in some spots. But it's well put together and makes a very intense sound. I'm actually thinking of wrapping a bit of cloth around the stick head (wooden) to muffle the sound. I realize some people may veer away from animal products, but the authenticity of the product, I think, is what helps me connect with it better. If it was mere synthetic I don't think I'd revere it very much."}
