{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003BFZI12', 'answerTime': 'Mar 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1362556800, 'question': 'would this fit an electromatic pro jet 125th anniversary ?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Karen, I think it will if it\'s an electromatic Pro Jet, which is what I won...I don\'t know that the 125th anniversary model is sized differently, maybe that info is on the Gretsch site. Usually you will find the case as a recommended accessory and get the correct model identified for you. I wasn\'t aware there was an anniversary model made. Total Length - 41" body length 19 1/2" width at lower bout 13 1/2"...upper bout 10 1/2" I would check the dimensions of the Pro Jet at the Gretsch site..those are the dimensions of my Pro Jet.'}
