{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003BLOSCG', 'answerTime': 'Jul 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406530800, 'question': 'Does anyone know if this would fit a Fender Toronado?', 'answer': 'The Fender Tornado has a shape that is sort of like the Jaguar\'s; I bought his case for my Jaguar and it fits very well. The problem with these guitars is that you need to find a case that is not for a "conventional" guitar (Les Paul type, or hollow bodies). This one is just fine for these "unconventional guitar shaped" because it is ample square, so you\'ll have plenty of room for it on the sides while holding it securely (it won\'t bounce in it). Its been a great case for my Jaguar! Hope it helps!'}
