{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003D2VT2K', 'answerTime': 'Jan 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390636800, 'question': 'will this mic work with TECHNICA ...', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'Assuming the question is whether the mic will work with an Audio-Technica body pack transmitter, the answer is no. This mic is wired for a Shure body pack. Audio-Technica and Shure both use 4-pin connectors; however, they are wired differently. The pin-out functions do not match. Audio-Technica: 1=ground; 2=line input; 3=mic input; 4=bias. Shure: 1=ground; 2=bias; 3=audio input; 4=ground through load. I do not believe that Pyle offers this mic with an Audio-Technica-wired connector.'}
