{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003F1PK42', 'answerTime': 'Mar 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394607600, 'question': 'How heavy is the violin?', 'answer': 'It is only slightly heavier than an acoustic. Just remember that it is electric, and it is cheap! For what it is I got plenty of use out of mine. You can turn up amp effects and rock the house or like me, I practice in hotel rooms without disturbing vermin.'}
