{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003F1TDBS', 'answerTime': 'Aug 7, 2013', 'unixTime': 1375858800, 'question': 'I just received mine.How do I connect the violin using the aux cable to my laptop?', 'answer': 'You either want to use an audio interface(preferred method) which has mic/line inputs. The cable has 1/8in to 1/4in jack 1/8 goes to violin & 1/4 to audio interface. Google audio interface, cheap ones start around $100..,or can get an 1/8in to 1/8in cable at radio shack or best buy and plug into mic input on computer. Not usually as good, will likely have noise issues, more feedback problems and latency(delay in signal)'}
