{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003FRMRC4', 'answerTime': 'Dec 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386662400, 'question': 'What is the difference between theDGX230 and theYPG235 Yamaha keyboards', 'answer': 'They are essentially the same keyboard. The DGX is marketed to beginners and the YPG to more advanced pianists, but as far as I can tell there are the same instrument. I bought a YPG235 for my teenage daughter and after playing it briefly can tell you that it is a very nice, affordable device. I am a big Yamaha fan and this keyboard was in line with my high expectations.'}
