{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003GEKXZY', 'answerTime': 'Dec 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417680000, 'question': "Considering this to replace a broken kid's karaoke mic. Is there an adapter I can use to make this fit a jack that is the size of standard headphones?", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes, you can go down to your local RadioShack or Best Buy or whatever you have locally and pick up a 1/4" to 3.5 mm adapter for $5-10. I personally did this and it worked quite well.'}
