{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003GUE1OW', 'answerTime': 'Apr 8, 2013', 'unixTime': 1365404400, 'question': 'is this a good saxophone for my son starting 6th grade band the school seems to think some of the cheaper bran please let me know if this will be good', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'We bought this sax for our 6th grader, knowing it wasnt a recognized name in instruments. I have had at least 3 music teachers look it over and tell us that we got a great deal. The tone of the instrument is fabulous. it is a great student instrument.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003GUE1OW', 'answerTime': 'Nov 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417161600, 'question': "what means ' set up adjusted and ready to play by our technicians in our house'", 'answer': 'this means before the item is shipped, a technician will play test and check to make sure that all the pads are closing properly, all the keys are working as they should, with no noise, etc.'}
