{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003GUE1OW', 'answerTime': 'Mar 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394006400, 'question': 'What are the accessories that come with this?', 'answer': "Accessories that are included are: carrying case, mouthpiece, ligature, cap, neck strap, pad saver, microfiber cloth, and one generic reed. All very basic and pictured. Carrying case zipper pull broke and had to replace case within first 3 months; company was nice to sell replacement at cost. Neck strap very basic so upgraded to a more padded version. Also upgraded pad saver to nicer one. My upgrades are all optional as the ones included are fine, just very basic. BEWARE: need to check the screws on the instrument on a regular basis as we've lost a few screws, though it's been over three years before it started happening. This instrument is being used by a student in school band."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003GUE1OW', 'answerTime': 'Aug 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409295600, 'question': 'Does it come with warranty?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I believe I bought this instrument with a warranty, but I didn't have the need to use it, it sounds fantastic; and it was a great investment for the price I paid, highly recommended for your young player. G."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003GUE1OW', 'answerTime': 'Jun 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403161200, 'question': 'Does the refurbished model also come with the case and accessories?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Mine was new. For the new ones absolutely! And what is so nice about the case, though the quality is superb, and protective it is not that bulky case. Over 25 years ago, I bought a sax for my son and it was stolen. I bought this as a graduation present for my granddaughter. When she presented it at her party, that son, now 31 seriously reacted. He became so emotional. Of all the gifts presented at the party, this saxophone stole the show. All the cameras started flashing. And this was a graduate appreciation party - the third generation honoring the older generation. Some put together jazz festivals and were musicians. Everyone loved that sax. It is an elegant masterpiece and a beautiful work of art. I don't know about the refurbished model."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003GUE1OW', 'answerTime': 'May 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401519600, 'question': 'where it was manufactured?', 'answer': 'China'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003GUE1OW', 'answerTime': 'May 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399532400, 'question': 'Am trying to decide if this is okay for my 7 year old, he is just starting his music class.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Excellent instrument for a beginning student! My daughter started with this instrument as a 7 yr old in 4th grade. She still plays it in 7th grade. The instrument has held up nicely and performs well with her advancing skills. Do check the screws regularly as they do loosen and fall out with normal use.'}
