{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003HR30FU', 'answerTime': 'Oct 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413442800, 'question': 'Can I use two mics similtaneously? I ordered one and the mic input on the right is not working. Just wondering if product is defective?', 'answer': 'The unit support 2 input and 2 output, which are separate. Check that you are in fact not turning the knob to direct the audio to USB. Also check that your levels are correct, in the VU meter on the device; both should light up when you send signals to both channels. Also check that your gain and your like selector is in the correct position.'}
