{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003LTJ404', 'answerTime': 'Dec 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1388044800, 'question': 'how do I assemble this stand?', 'answer': "Set up the base of the stand so that the legs are all even. Then line up the holes of the stand (The part you're going to be putting the music on) with the hole at the top of the base. Put the screw through one side & then screw the black know onto the other end. Make sure you adjust the stand to where you want it before tightening the knob all the way."}
