{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003OURTDY', 'answerTime': 'Jun 19, 2013', 'unixTime': 1371625200, 'question': 'How much does it really weigh and is it really 2 ohm stable??', 'answer': 'Hello- It weights out of the box around 14.5 lbs. It can power @ 2 ohm (3850W x 1 Channel @ 2 Ohms) and (3750W x 2 Channels @ 2 ohms). The information on the Amazon page is outdated. We have requested that Amazon update the information but that has not happend yet. The total power ratings are as follows: - 3850W RMS x 1 Channel at 2 ohms - 2400W RMS x 1 Channel at 4 ohms - 1330W RMS x 1 Channel at 8 ohms - 3750W RMS x 2 Channels at 2 ohms - 2022W RMS x 2 Channels at 4 ohms - 1250W RMS x 2 Channels at 8 ohms -West Music Company'}
