{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003OYLGWA', 'answerTime': 'Nov 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415606400, 'question': "I have the Fender Mustang I V2 Amplifier. Can I choose which 2 settings to switch between when I use this switch? It's not giving me an option.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I have this pedal and the Mustang II V2 myself. The pedal doesn't give you the option, your amp does. When you change to one of the 24 different preset sounds and then change any dials you will see the SAVE button light up. Press the SAVE button and it saves it. Do all of that again to save a second setting. Then press the button on your footswitch to switch between the two saved settings. You will see there is a GREEN saved channel and a RED saved channel. The footswitch allows you to switch between them."}
