{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003Q0FMQS', 'answerTime': 'Dec 16, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387180800, 'question': 'Will this fit a vestax vci-380 plus 17" laptop?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The Mono EFX Kondensor bag will hold up to and including a 17" laptop. The Rear compartment is 38cm x 32cm x 7.5cm. The Front compartment is 36cm x 30.5cm x 7cm. Vestax lists the VCI380 as 42.7cm x 30.4cm x 6cm, so I do not believe this bag will accommodate it. The Mono EFX-365 might be a better fit: http://www.amazon.com/MONO-EFX-EFX-365-BLK-Mixer-Case/dp/B002FKBHHS/ref=sr_1_1?m=A345OSUWOYF1PV&s=merchant-items&ie=UTF8&qid=1387230083&sr=1-1&keywords=mono+efx+efx-365-blk'}
