{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003UIBQEI', 'answerTime': 'Mar 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394953200, 'question': 'Is there an aux input on this thing if I want to plug in an iPod or external music source to play along with?', 'answer': 'Nope. But if you got clever with mixing in a 2 to 1 splitter on the input side you should be able to accomplish the same thing. I say clever because the input is 1/4 and obviously what you plug in will be 1/8. You will also lose the stereo since the output is only mono. Still may be worth it since this sucker is pretty good at amping up and is affordable and durable.'}
