{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003VCCUKM', 'answerTime': 'Oct 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414134000, 'question': 'How do I reduce the hum from this thing? I just got it today. Any suggestions???', 'answer': 'If you are using a guitar cord from the output to the amp, you will get noise. What I do is use speaker wire which has no winding ground wrapped around the main (lead) wire. This prevents the cord from picking up outside interfernce.'}
