{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003VQLBX0', 'answerTime': 'Jan 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388649600, 'question': 'is this RGB Color Changing Magic LED can be installed outside in snow,rain and sun?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes. I live in Hawaii and have used several sets through a couple of holiday seasons. Instead of utiizing the 3M foam tape on the back, I just use cable ties to attach everything to my lanai railings. Rain and sun haven't had any observable effect. Do be careful not to put kinks or abrupt bends, and (if binding as I do) don't pinch the strip too tightly."}
