{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003VXNPN2', 'answerTime': 'Jul 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405148400, 'question': 'Has anyone replaced their Taylor ES with this LR Baggs Anthem and if so, happy or regrets? I think my Taylor ES sounds a lot brighter than my guitar', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I have a Taylor with the ES, and then i put this LR BAGGS on a $300 yamaha-- the Yamaha now sounds better (plugged in) and is my guitar of choice. I was blown away by the sonic quality of this pickup. (I am a church worship leader)'}
