{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003Y3ASW0', 'answerTime': 'Feb 11, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423641600, 'question': "I have 2 Digitech pedals that says it needs 4.8 watts each. I have no idea how many mA's this is. Can anyone help?", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'The 4.8 watts is the power needed for each pedal. Power = Current x Voltage. so, the current is the power divided by the voltage Ex: If the pedal is 9 volts then Current = 4.8 / 9 Current = 0.533 A or 533mA Did it help?'}
