{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003YCZ1F0', 'answerTime': 'Jul 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404284400, 'question': 'I have a Honda GL 1500, Can I connect this system to OEM radio/comm plug, and if so what do I need to do that?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "By the way, the Sena SMH-A0302 that is shown here is great for full-face and modular helmets. If you have an open-face 3/4 helmet, the SMH-3A0301 is a better choice because of it's fixed boom mic. The SMH-A0303 would work best for shorty 1/2 helmets that have open ears because you would use your own earbuds since your ears are covered by the helmet. I've never used an audio set-up on a 1/2 helmet so I don't know how well it would work, but I do recommend the first 2 products."}
