{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0041OT5MU', 'answerTime': 'Jan 26, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422259200, 'question': 'New uke &amp; it sounds "off". When I play each string separately, it sounds in-tune but when I strum all four together, it sounds out-of-tune, why?', 'answer': 'My guess is you have one string not quite perfectly tuned. Are you using a clip on tuner, a tuner app or another instrument to tune? Recommend using uke app for each string, or clip on tuner.'}
