{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0041OT5MU', 'answerTime': 'Aug 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406876400, 'question': 'I got this today but it is easily out of tuned (every hour). Is this normal for a new instrument?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "This is a common issue with new instruments. As you continue to play and use it, the strings will become used to the level of tension that is placed on them. It isn't so much a problem with new instruments as it is with new strings. Every time you replace the strings you will have the same difficulty."}
