{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0041T4DK4', 'answerTime': 'Apr 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398322800, 'question': 'Will this work on a 6-string banjitar?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It should...depends on the length of the bridge as this mute is simply a brass sleeve that slides across the bridge (ref the picture) to tone down the vibration. To be honest, it changes the tone to some degree (not the pitch), but the volume is only marginally reduced. I must say, I like the result, but it does take some getting used to.'}
