{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0042EZH6W', 'answerTime': 'Nov 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383375600, 'question': 'can you plug in an acoustic guitar?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'You can plug in anything that uses 1/4 mono instrument cable (an electric guitar cable). That includes most acoustics with a pickup. Just be aware that this amp is made to color the sound, so if you want an "acoustic" sound, you\'re better off with a amp built for acoustics.'}
