{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0042EZH6W', 'answerTime': 'Oct 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414047600, 'question': 'If you buy a new one, does its come with enough instructions for a novice to set up different sounds on the amp?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Collin, be aware that there is a newer version of this amp. It comes with a variety of setups. The sounds are endless on this amp. You have every effect there is and you can put them in any order. You can go on Fender's web site and download thousands of set ups. I did only that for awhile - then I did my own. It would be very difficult to do a set up using the amp's controls (knobs). You really need to use the computer interface. So it's not an instant process. But you can learn it pretty quickly."}
