{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0042Z3ADI', 'answerTime': 'Jan 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388995200, 'question': 'How is the audio quality, compared with Focusrite gear in the same price range (e.g., Scarlett 2i2)?', 'answer': "I would rather have a 2i2 based on the audio quality but the Akai EIE has additional features to justify its price. That being said I would rather have any Scarlett over the EIE. Focusrite's claim to fame is the quality of their converters. All of the Scarletts have the same converters, but the rest of the audio path gets better as you look at more expensive models. If you want really good audio quality for the money buy the 2i2. If you want better audio quality buy a more expensive model such as the Scarlett 18i20."}
