{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043517PA', 'answerTime': 'Mar 31, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427785200, 'question': 'What program do you use to record with im waiting for mines to come in tryna make sure i know everything i need to know before it comes', 'answer': 'We\'ve been using "MAGIX Music Maker 2013". We got it cheap and it\'s works pretty well. Very easy software to learn. Depending on what you are doing with it though, it can get kind of glitchy to work with. We record several tracks together on a compilation, and we\'ve been running into lag issues with it. As long as you can work around it, you should be fine. Just be aware that it IS a pretty big problem with this particular software. But you can\'t beat the price!'}
