{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004444O3W', 'answerTime': 'Feb 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1361952000, 'question': 'Are these good to listen to, hip hop, rap, metal, techno, dub step, salsa, bachata, pop, pop-rock, R&amp;B, Latin &amp; alt-rock? i like to listen to pretty m', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'If you enjoy a good bass, then no. These are incredibly detailed and natural sounding, but light on the bass. Sennheiser or Beyerdynamic are better in the bass department.'}
