{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004444O3W', 'answerTime': 'Aug 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407222000, 'question': 'I heard the white one selling is made in China already , how about the black one ? Still possible be old stock from Austria ?', 'answer': "The black one I purchased was made in China. Regardless, it's a great headphone with impressive sound. I recently compared it to a pair of Audeze LCD-2s (source: NuForce Icon iDo with an iPod Classic as the digital source, running ALAC (lossless) files), and the AKG compared much better than I thought it would. The LCD-2 is great, but the AKG gets 90 percent of the way there at 1/4 of the price."}
