{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00448Y6RM', 'answerTime': 'May 3, 2013', 'unixTime': 1367564400, 'question': 'i don;t get it - how does the crank/raiser work? also is it a tripod or just a pole?', 'answer': 'The pole is intended to slip into the pole mount, located on a subwoofer. Drop the pole into the pole mount on the sub. Adjust the height of the pole. Tighten the knob, put in the safety pin. Lift speaker and place on top of the pole. Done. There is no crank on this pole.'}
