{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0045EP4WG', 'answerTime': 'Nov 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415606400, 'question': 'how many of these would be good for a four panel scrim ?', 'answer': 'for best results you would need one Am. DJ Supply Mega Bar for each panel. This would not allow cross lighting for the back panels. To add xlighting effect, you would need to add one at a minimum of one additional.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0045EP4WG', 'answerTime': 'Aug 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408604400, 'question': 'Are these bright enough to show solid color on a white wall with three 60-watt bulbs on or would the LEDs get washed out?', 'answer': 'It would depend on how close the 60-watt bulbs were to where the Mega Bar was casting its light and how much area it was casting to, but would say that it would be washed out, and not very dramatic as where there was little light. The light is focused but not really all that bright.'}
