{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0045XUU08', 'answerTime': 'Dec 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419321600, 'question': 'Will this make me be able to play exactly like Neil Peart? Or do I have to spend more on a better kit?', 'answer': 'Yes, this drum kit will make you better than Neil Peart. This kit is one thousand times better than any kit on the market. Beware however; if you want to play as good as Keith Moon, you must drink several bottles of booze and consume mass quantities of pills.'}
