{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00466HM28', 'answerTime': 'Mar 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395817200, 'question': 'Does the midi controller perform the same operations as the MPC1000? (Is it better to have both, or one or the other?) Thanks', 'answer': 'They\'re significantly different pieces of equipment. The MPK Mini has no "brain", it\'s strictly a MIDI controller for software on a computer. If that\'s all you need and the controls on this unit are sufficient for your needs, it\'s a nice piece of equipment.'}
