{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0049S6GRK', 'answerTime': 'Apr 5, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428217200, 'question': 'Would this fit an Ibanez Iron Label RGIR28FE 8 string?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "On theory it should. I have 4 of this cases. I used them on 6 and 7 strings guitars with no issues. All Ibanez RG bodies should be the same size. I was told that the difference between 6, 7 or 8 strings Ibanez RGs is the width of the neck. I have never played an 8 string, therefore I can't be 100% sure. It is a great case. Revise the return policy before ordering, and the seller terms. If it doesn't fit, you should be able to return or exchange it. I hope this helped."}
