{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004A8ZNCI', 'answerTime': 'Jan 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389168000, 'question': 'Does this unit work with the Chauvet 4 Bar? Im not sure if the 4 Bar is wireless. Can the Obey 4 also be plugged in?', 'answer': "The 4 Bar is not wireless. Obey 4 will work with the 4 Bar, but why? Almost all of the functions of the Obey 4 are built in to the 4 Bar and can be controlled by the foot switch. The 4 Bar can be set to either 3 or 15 DMX channels and can thus be used with pretty much any DMX controller. I have a 4 Play which is similar to the 4 Bar and I set it to auto sound activated play. and use the Obey 4 to control 16 other separate assorted Par cans (usually setting the Obey to auto sound mode). Try Chauvet's website for details of the 4 Bar (or any of their products): http://www.chauvetlighting.com/4-bar.html"}
