{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004ARUO2S', 'answerTime': 'Jun 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1370156400, 'question': 'What should I be looking if I want headphones that sound loud?', 'answer': "These headphones can get the job done but if you want something that can just get really loud you need to look more into the specifications. Not sure what in particular is important but I know it comes down to physics. It may be the transducer/amp/or ohms. Try googling it. These headphones get loud and don't get muddy which is good as well. Try googling and read up on some stuff."}
