{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004C5DLBE', 'answerTime': 'Jun 17, 2013', 'unixTime': 1371452400, 'question': 'Does it buzz like the VT40', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I have found that as with any amp I have ever used, It depends on where and what....Where you are in the room and what other devices you have around that might cause that problem. Guitar model pick ups also...I use a Gibson SG w/ P-90 pick ups. Best to just move the amp around or move to a non buzzing area. Hope that helps Phil......Robbinn...PS//// I love my VT 80 and VERY happy with it.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004C5DLBE', 'answerTime': 'Feb 16, 2013', 'unixTime': 1361001600, 'question': 'Does this come with a warranty ?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It has a limited one year warranty. There is a card to register the amp, but the warranty is still in effect from date of purchase even if you don't return the card. You won't find a better, more powerful amp for the money."}
