{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004GXA41C', 'answerTime': 'May 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401087600, 'question': "Can this replace crappy Windows sound card? Enhance sound quality for WAV and MP3's exported from DAWs like Reason, Cubase, Adobe Audition?", 'answer': 'Absolutely my friend. This is a pro. Audio card. You can do a professional recording with this and send it to record companies. Top end. If price is issue look at roland audio cards too. Cheaper and do the same job. I bought tri by roland very cheap and good card. But this rme is up there withe best. Good luck :-). Whatever u do dont buy Motu audio cards. They are faulty and horrible. I tasted that before and had too many problems.'}
