{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004HJ1ZB8', 'answerTime': 'Dec 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386662400, 'question': 'does this laptop stand for DJ fold up to fit in car', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It doesn't fold up. You'd have to disassemble it. It's not too difficult to disassemble and re-assemble, but it's more of a pain than merely folding it up. Truthfully, I don't know that I'd use it to travel and gig with...especially when you have it setup at the higher levels. It's stable enough for home use for me at the higher levels, but I wouldn't trust drunks around it. I'd pay the extra cash for something for stable."}
