{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004HJ1TTQ', 'answerTime': 'Sep 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409641200, 'question': 'Does this thing have an/off switch or do you need to plug/unplug everytime you use it?', 'answer': "No. No on/off switch. Plug the wall wart (power supply) into a switched power supply such as a power strip, power conditioner, etc. Wouldn't recommend just leaving it on all of the time when not in use. Product works very well for what it is intended for."}
