{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004HJ3K2U', 'answerTime': 'Jan 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390032000, 'question': "Can someone tell me, why my system doesn't work when I take out the plug. it only works when plugged to an outlet.", 'answer': "It's because the original charger that's built into the unit is not a smart charger. So I bought a Del Trans smart charger, then i went to radio installer and had them put a new electrical connector at the original battery to accept the quick disconnect cord from the Del Trans smart charger. Then I cut a notch into the battery door so the other end of the quick disconnect cord can be accessed. When I'm not using the PA I keep the charger plugged in 24/7. So when I'm ready to use the PA it's always fully charged."}
