{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004KCL5LW', 'answerTime': 'Feb 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392019200, 'question': 'can you use it as a cd player into your stereo from the rca outs?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Yes. You can enter into 'CD' mode, mount a CD, select 'CD Player' and using the rotary encoder wheel highlight a track to start playing from that track. The CD will continue to play until the last track has played. Output is at the RCA line outs and headphone jack. The Master volume does not control the output to the line outs."}
