{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004KPB9X8', 'answerTime': 'May 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399186800, 'question': 'is there a replacement head for it', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I don\'t know about that. You\'d likely have to contact Roland. They do mention not using felt beaters though. I made the mistake once and it marked it up almost instantly and looked like it could do damage fast. I get the feeling the felt beaters "grab" the pad material and pull it apart.'}
