{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004NRVUMI', 'answerTime': 'Mar 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394953200, 'question': 'Will the at92e or at95e fit on Technics SL-1950?', 'answer': "The SL-1950 uses a removable headshell with 1/2 inch mounting holes. The at92e is a P-mount cartridge which includes an adapter for 1/2 inch mounting. The at95e is a 1/2 inch mounting cartridge. I'd choose the at95e and avoid the adapter."}
