{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004QJOZS4', 'answerTime': 'Jan 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390118400, 'question': 'How close do you have to have the mic in order for it to get good volume? Can I sit back a bit, or do I have to be right on top of it?', 'answer': "I'm no expert but, any good mic requires you to be fairly close unless you are looking at using a shotgun mic. With this mic, I suggest you be about a fist length away. This is an extremely good mic, it compares to my Heil PR 40 which cost me about $340."}
