{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004RKH0P2', 'answerTime': 'Mar 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396249200, 'question': 'We have various instruments for worship service-I need decent tone. Can I use this for common stringed instruments? Also, does it adhear to the inst', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I have only used these pickups on an acoustic guitar and ukulele. The tone is great! The pickup attaches to the instrument with a clay-like adhesive that comes with it. You may need to play around with location of the pickup in order to get the kind of sound you are looking for, kind of an individual preference.'}
