{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004S8AU2I', 'answerTime': 'Jun 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404111600, 'question': 'does this attach to speakers?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No. This attaches to a PC running using USB (thru MIDI protocol). The software on your laptop, then uses the laptop audio to mix music, change the speed, select tracks. Instead of using the computer keyboard and mouse to control the software, you can use this controller. The computer emulates the functions of mixers, speed control, turntables, etc. to let you DJ with this, a laptop and amplifier. Nothing else needed except maybe a Mic mixer..'}
