{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004STXY3E', 'answerTime': 'Feb 3, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422950400, 'question': "Is there a limit to the number of compatible fixtures the ADJ RGB3C will control when they're DMX daisy-chained together?", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "You're limited by the length of the cable run(s), the quality of the cable, and whether there is termination. 10 fixtures with 15' cables between work just fine."}
