{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004T0BM0O', 'answerTime': 'Dec 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419753600, 'question': 'How long is the power cord, before the string of lights begin?', 'answer': 'Well, that is open to interpretation. The AC chord from the wall to the transformer is 46" inches. The transformer supply line to the controller is another 46" inches. The control module has a 10" inch tail to the connector on the light string, and a 6" tail with the IR receiver sensor. And the light string has a 6" line with connector head for the controller module. for a total of 114" inches (9.5\' feet).'}
