{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004TM31FG', 'answerTime': 'Feb 27, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425024000, 'question': 'For those who have had this unit for over a year, is the mixer still working 100%? Does the mixer get really hot?', 'answer': "The mixer is still working great for me. I store it in my garage, and since I live in Arizona, the temp goes from close to freezing to blistering hot. Hasn't caused any issues yet. I haven't noticed the mixer getting really hot after usage but I only use it about once a week for around 3 hours. No issues at all other than I might be ready for a larger mixer now. Great 1st mixer for my 4-5 piece band."}
