{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004Z8VQ2O', 'answerTime': 'Dec 17, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387267200, 'question': "I'm getting a lot of feedback with higher gain using my headphone jack plug (the Positive Grid JamUp). Is the Apogee JAM better at avoiding feedback?", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The Positive Grid JamUp plug is a total swindle and is not worth 10c. The problem is bad build, really bad build. Hint: toss it out the Jam-Up (or better still, take the sissors to it) and get the Apogee. The Apogee is clean, clear, reliable and does not feedback!!'}
