{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00501ISJ4', 'answerTime': 'Oct 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413961200, 'question': 'will it break when it comes in the mail', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'My saxophone came shipped by UPS service. The box it came in was the original Mendini box or carton. The saxophone I received was shipped with no problem from KK Music Store. They stipulate if there is a problem of breakage to report it in 24 hours. The saxophone will probably be sent UPS or FED EX as I don`t think the US mail will handle something as big as that. As to your question, will it break ? I guess that depends on how rough they handle it in shipping. Make a claim right away if it does come damaged or broken.'}
