{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0050CEEIW', 'answerTime': 'Aug 18, 2013', 'unixTime': 1376809200, 'question': 'Will this cable send audio to the usb of my laptop?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'According to their website, yes. However, I am not sure about the wiring of the 3 pin XLR. It could be wired as "balanced audio" or as "unbalanced audio". Balanced audio puts the sound on pins 2 and 3 with 1 being a ground. Unbalanced is usually using only 2 wires, so it might be any combination of and 2 wires. A little experimentation should provide results. In my case, I was using balanced audio and it worked just fine.'}
