{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0050JHNHO', 'answerTime': 'Nov 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1416902400, 'question': 'Absolute audio beginner.. I have a Peavey PR 15 speaker currently hooked up to my amp which is a Crown x1000 (2x300 watt amp). Can I add this sub?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes. There are a few ways you can hook it all up together, however I would also recommend investing in a crossover as well. Pushing a full-spectrum signal to a sub muddies it up quickly, and the PR-15s aren't exactly designed for earth-shaking low end. A crossover will clean things up a bit. I'd do a little research before investing further."}
