{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0051M6JJI', 'answerTime': 'Apr 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397113200, 'question': 'If I install it on my current computer and upgrade to a different computer (like I am planning to), will I have to buy another copy of the software?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I don't believe so. if you purchase any software from anyone it will be the same. Keep all of your paperwork, activation codes etc and usually any company will allow you to use it on at least 2 computers. I think I have it on 3 at present. This one is pretty tough to learn. I haven't had time or the inclination to invest in learning it."}
