{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0051TZAGE', 'answerTime': 'Dec 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417766400, 'question': 'I was going to purchase just one unit for mono referencing but see many people buy them in pairs. Any advice which would be best?', 'answer': 'I prefer pairs because it makes it nice if you want to use for mono check or for stereo "crappy real world" comparison. it\'s also nice if you\'re in a spot where you wanna edit a little louder than normal but can\'t neccesarily use bass heavy speakers. plus for the price you really can\'t complain.'}
