{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0051WAJ5S', 'answerTime': 'Jul 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404543600, 'question': 'Is the tubing used on this stand safe with all guitar finishes? If not, which ones is it not safe to use with?', 'answer': 'If you have guitars for show then you may want to place them in glass cases. Otherwise guitars that are played will show some wear. The rack is great and makes my guitars accessible. If you do not plan on playing them, I would suggest using the case they came with (or one you purchased seperately to store them). Just play them and as always have fun my friend!'}
