{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0053CUHMG', 'answerTime': 'Mar 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395471600, 'question': '1) Do I need to buy a cable to connect the ukelele to amplifier. If yes, which one? 2) What shoulder strap to buy t connect to ukelele. Thanks', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': '1.) You need a cable AND an amplifier. ...l had to live & learn. Little Honeytone amp is what l got but l am silly not serious (it said you could clip it to your belt = no, we are not that nerdy.) See what Amazon or Guitar Center have. 2.) You can use a nice piece of trim from the fabric store as a strap. A serious strap is overkill for this cute little Les Paul. EVERYONE loves mine / everyone wants to play it. So l share. Fun !'}
