{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0053CUHMG', 'answerTime': 'Nov 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415174400, 'question': 'I received 3 different answers - soprano, concert and tenor. Dealer here says it only comes in sorpano. What size is this???', 'answer': 'I own this Uke. They only come in one size and that is concert. Tell your dealer to count the frets. It will have more than 12 frets making it a concert and this Uke is too small and not enough frets to make this a tenor. I own several soprano, concert, tenor and baraton Ukulele.'}
