{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0053H8Z5C', 'answerTime': 'Jul 3, 2013', 'unixTime': 1372834800, 'question': 'Does it make a good sound? Is it in good shape when you bought it?', 'answer': 'It was in excellent shape when I bought it. It sounds good to me (as a parent) and I find that it is staying in tune now better than when we first bought it. So I would recommend it as a beginner violin.'}
