{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0054U46Y2', 'answerTime': 'Jul 23, 2013', 'unixTime': 1374562800, 'question': 'I would like to put these on our RV. will these lights work on straight 12 volt DC running off our battery?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I'm not sure. Call LEDwholesalers they might be able to get you a different power adapter. They were very helpful when I had questions."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0054U46Y2', 'answerTime': 'Dec 18, 2012', 'unixTime': 1355817600, 'question': 'If I buy two kits for my kitchen will 1 remote control both lite strips or will I have to us both remotes', 'answer': 'Yes, I bought two kits installed them both and use one remote to operate both. The IR sensor is small and near the control unit so make sure they are placed in an area where the remote can see both.'}
