{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00551VDIM', 'answerTime': 'Jan 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390377600, 'question': 'Can I Connect 4 lavalier Wireless Mics on this item and I can connect a couple of Speakers to this mixer?', 'answer': 'You can connect anything that has 1/4" plugs, RCA plugs and XLR plugs. So if your mics and speakers have those kinds of cables, you can connect them to the mixer. If not, you can also find adapters. For example you may need a 3.5mm to 1/4" adapter, or a 1/4" adapter to XLR. Whatever combination you may need is probably findable on Amazon.'}
