{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0057UGW5A', 'answerTime': 'Aug 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407222000, 'question': 'I am beginning to learn the violin and just bought this one. I was wondering how to properly attach the shoulder rest that came with it.', 'answer': 'The shoulder rest goes on the back of the violin. The sides of the shoulder rest should pull straight out. Then tighten them back to fit the violin. Hope this helps'}
