{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005BSOVRY', 'answerTime': '24 days ago', 'question': 'My mic came in today and the cables inside were not soldered, is that how it should be?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It's a common problem with these, the solder job isn't the best on these. Once you resolder these they're pretty reliable. I don't ever complain about this cause its a sub $20 mic. A few fixes on these and they aren't that bad"}
