{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005DUR7U8', 'answerTime': 'Apr 5, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428217200, 'question': 'How many of these amps can you plug into one outlet (with a power strip)? Any special extension cord you should use to power these up?', 'answer': 'I don\'t claim to be an electrical engineer but I run two of these and my mixer through a 15a power strip with no problems. Thats probably not "code" but most places you play are lucky to find more than 2 outlets for the whole stage. As a side note I run either 2 or 4 -15s in stereo with one and 4 monitors with the second so you can get an idea of the load on the amps.'}
