{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005EHIN12', 'answerTime': 'Jun 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404111600, 'question': "I am running two peavey Black widow 15's with horns is this amp powerful enough to reach loud. and does it help the bass", 'answer': 'The amp is great. Never had any issues with it. It will put out 160W per channel at 8 ohms ( I believe Peavey Black Widows are 8 ohms) Depending where you are using the setup, it should be loud enough.'}
