{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005ETZN72', 'answerTime': 'Jan 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389859200, 'question': 'Does this come with a set-up?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "The set up from the factory was perfect for the OU5 that I got. Another Uke that I bought needed the fret ends polished . The neck on a ukulele isn't under the same stress as a guitar neck. Fewer strings with a lot less tension on a much shorter neck mean truss rod adjustments and bridge alterations aren't normally required. Most ukes don't even have truss rods so the saddle height is factory set for most players."}
