{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005ETZN72', 'answerTime': 'Mar 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394607600, 'question': 'Getting frustrated w/guitar, is this really that much easier? Can you find tabs easily online?', 'answer': 'Uke tabs are everywhere!! Just google the song name plus "uke tab," \'twill be easy. I\'ve been playing every day for the last four and a half months (I bought an Hola! soprano ukulele before my stunning Oscar Schmidt), and I\'m officially obsessed! WAY easier than guitar, only four strings, and a fun vibe all its own. By the by, this one takes a little while to open up (about a month), and it doesn\'t yet hold tune perfectly (matter of time?), but the sound is INSANE, I love her! Take the leap!'}
