{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005FPXM0U', 'answerTime': 'Nov 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415433600, 'question': 'Are the keys accurately in tune? Can this be played in an ensemble?', 'answer': "I just tried hitting a chromatic scale while holding a tuner next to it. It appears to depend on how I hit it and which mallets are used. It was generally within 10 cents of an equal temperament scale although I hit some sour tones when I wasn't careful about hitting the center. Almost no reverb on it so I don't think it would clash in an ensemble."}
