{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005G6CZRE', 'answerTime': 'Oct 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414306800, 'question': "How well does this work with a mac? I'm torn between this and the Scarlett 212 but I read Scarlett has mac compatibility issues. True?", 'answer': "I sue this interface on my Mac Book Air and it works flawlessly with the included Studio One software which is one of the best DAW's available. This interface is clean, quiet, and is well suited for professional applications. My only issue was that I wish I had opted for the step up and gotten the 4 input XLR version. Never the less, I am more than happy with my Persons purchase and will be a customer for a very long time."}
