{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005H2007E', 'answerTime': 'Nov 16, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384588800, 'question': "Will this work on a kid's guitar?", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes, the pickup will work on any sound hole that is wider than 3 inches. I have it on a full size acoustic and there is plenty of room to go smaller. It will also fit on my 3/4 size classical guitar which has a much smaller sound hole and still has at least an inch more it could go smaller. As long as the kids guitar has metal and not nylon strings ( it won't pickup the sound vibrations off a nylon string) it will work with no problem."}
