{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005I0HTCY', 'answerTime': 'Aug 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408345200, 'question': 'Is it good to record music? Like vocals and like music in the background?', 'answer': "I use it for voice. The quality is good to very good on both my laptop and desktop using the free Audacity software available at http://audacity.sourceforge.net/ The mike tends to pop, but I put a 'wind sock over it and adjusted the mic boost in the sound section of the control panel of Windows and have been delighted considering the cost."}
