{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005I2YJPM', 'answerTime': 'Dec 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386748800, 'question': 'What are the uses you have given to this item? And how is the built and performance quality?', 'answer': "I use the amplifier in the classroom daily and the product is made of good quality, easy to use. However, I would prefer that the belt fasteners were better attached to the amplifier, but it is a great product and worth the money if you talk alot to save your vocals. On the days I don't use it, my voice is strained."}
