{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005N2RGJ8', 'answerTime': 'Mar 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395298800, 'question': 'Is this all you need in terms of making the tuning machine without anything else', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes, this is the entire tuning machine. You screw it into the guitar headstock, put your new string through it, then turn it until it's in tune. The package includes the screws to attach it to the headstock. Just double-check the dimension of this tuning machine to make sure it's as long as your current tuning machine."}
