{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005OH07ZM', 'answerTime': 'Jun 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402038000, 'question': 'How many additional single-zone pads can I connect to the SPD-SX? Only 2, or 4?', 'answer': 'It has 2 ports for external pads. The dual zone pads actually use a stereo 1/4 inch cable. In theory, you could use a splitter and break it out into 4 pads split between the 2 inputs. I have not tried this on the SPD-SX, but I know this process does work with other Roland products.'}
