{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005OQ77ZQ', 'answerTime': 'Jul 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405062000, 'question': 'Is this good for church activity?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "This is great for church activities. There are three bands for this series, so you can have more than one going at the same time. If you use more than one on the same band, it will cause a static sound. The best thing is that it runs off of only one AA battery. The bad thing is that the handset will pick up any tapping like putting it down on a table or tapping it with anything. My suggestion would be to keep the gain at about 9 o'clock and turn up the channel on your mixer."}
