{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005OUE3FO', 'answerTime': 'Dec 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386576000, 'question': "what kind of equipment will I need in conjunction with this machine or is it and stand alone item? I'm fairly new to music. anything advice would help.", 'answer': 'Thats depends on the complexity and the kind of music you are thinking. This machine was planned to be as a beat maker, so you can make a complete song with its on built 3 part sequencer. Obviously its better for hiphop related music, but still found very useful for a vast range of music styles. Very good for entry level, even medium range. No sampling functionality, but still good enough pre loaded high quality samples, cover almost any musical style (but again, better for hiphop). Anyway its a sequencer monster with midi capabilities, so you are able to control midi modules and sound generators.'}
