{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005PNXT6E', 'answerTime': 'May 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1400569200, 'question': 'My keyboard has both 1/4 and 1/8 outputs, does 1/4 output, or cables, give more volume? Better sound?', 'answer': "The only difference is that the plug is better connected, I mean, physically, so it won't disconnect and you should get a better ground signal. Also, as the plug is bigger a thicker cable can be attached to it lowering noise/sound ratio."}
