{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005SUN7R0', 'answerTime': 'Jan 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389168000, 'question': 'What speaker ohm rating will this amp take?', 'answer': '8 ohms single speaker. The detail says speakers. And there are two 1/4" speaker outputs on the rear. I have not tried those. Using the speakon outlet, I tried to daisy chain two 8 ohm speakers. But every few minutes the amp would go into protect. Maybe the 1/4" outputs will allow two speakers but not the speakon. I\'d have returned it but this is the only mixer amp in this price range on the market. I use it for all karaoke shows. It really does crank great sound.'}
