{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005SUU7H8', 'answerTime': 'Aug 29, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377759600, 'question': 'will a SQUIER STRATOCASTER by fender fit perfectly in this case? thank you', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "My Deluxe Player's Strat is very similar to the Squier in shape and dimension. It fits very well in this case, and the case is very nice. The one complication is that the vibrato (tremolo) bar must be removed to close the case. I'm careful not to over tighten the bar when I screw it back in. Since I'm lazy, I use a soft case most times so I don't have to remove the bar to put the guitar away, but I love having this fine case, and it's great protection. Warm regards."}
