{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005T600D2', 'answerTime': 'Feb 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392019200, 'question': 'Would these cables work for the mixer Pyle Pro PPMJL30 30\' Professional Microphone Cable 1/4" Male to XLR Female?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It depends on what side of the cable you plan to plug into the mixer. The 1/4" jack works perfectly, however, keep in mind that you can\'t use phantom power with a 1/4" jack. You can\'t really use the female microphone cable side because there isn\'t a male outlet on the mixer. I would definitly recommend this mixer. Not only have I used this mixer at home, but our amps died in our auditorium and we use this little mixer to provide power to all of our hanging stage mics. It works perfectly and I haven\'t had any issues with it.'}
