{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005WS0Z8M', 'answerTime': 'Mar 23, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427094000, 'question': 'Every one says to get a better mouthpiece. Do I need large or small shank?', 'answer': 'I have my Bach 11 and the P-Bone plastique in the case. I play at a very low "wine bar volume". I prefer the plastic one for comfort and better low pressure control. Also, my best advice to you on this novel and fun to play horn, which I gig about 3 days a week, keep the slide dry, swab the slide\'s insides after each use! I haven\'t found a better working slide lubricant system yet.'}
