{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0062RMHRO', 'answerTime': 'Jul 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405666800, 'question': 'Different kinds of mahogany react different ways to sanding and staining/dyeing and such. What kind of mahogany is used for this guitar?', 'answer': 'These bodies are made of basswood, not mahogany. They would be more expensive if mahogany. Basswood is easily sanded and stained. Glue stains will show up after staining. There are plenty of instructional videos on YouTube.'}
