{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006MNGBR0', 'answerTime': 'Dec 3, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386057600, 'question': 'Will this work with an LED dimmer on the Line voltage side like Lutron DVLV-600p rather than the output 12v side?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The LED Wholesalers website has a list of compatible dimmers and the DVLV-600P is on the list. http://ledwholesalers.com/instructions/dimmable_transformer_compatibility.htm'}
