{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0078SAJ7Q', 'answerTime': 'Jun 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402297200, 'question': 'Can I keep my ipad charging at the same time? I need to broadcast a ceremony (1-2 hours long...) and worry about the battery life.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Mikey connects to the iPad via the same port as the battery charger. However, Mikey has a mini USB port on the side which, with the proper cable, you will be able to charge the iPad while recording with Mikey. However, if you have your iPad full charged before you begin recording, I think you should have no trouble in recording two hours without charging.'}
