{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0078SAJ7Q', 'answerTime': 'Feb 6, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423209600, 'question': 'I need a mic to record classroom discussions. Will this mic capture the voices a class of about 20 people if it is sitting in the middle of the group?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes. There are three pickup volume settings. If you are trying to capture speaking voices, use the lowest (one bar) setting and it should record everyone who speaks. Although, if people in the back speak softly, it may be more difficult to hear on the recording.'}
