{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0078SAJ7Q', 'answerTime': 'Feb 5, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423123200, 'question': 'will this record loud music like a live band ?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes, there are three mode settings (silver toggle switch on front of device) for either quiet, loud, or auto. I play drums but when I used the loud mode it was super faint, and yet with the auto mode it is really boomy so you need to be farther away and perhaps point the mic away from the source. Ultimately this works but it is nothing like true, dedicated mics with real separation. It's good for a stopgap solution but that's about it."}
