{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007D7P06W', 'answerTime': 'Aug 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406876400, 'question': 'So the 2 provided mics can be used simultaneously because of the dual channel, but can a 3rd wired mic be used also when plugged into the 6.5mic jack?', 'answer': 'Absolutely. And a fourth. One of the plugins must be a "dynamic" mike (upper, 1/4-inch or 6.5-mm jack) and the other must be a "ceramic" mike (second, 1/8-inch or 3.5-mm jack). Plus you can add MP3 music via the third "aux in" jack. You can even add several more mikes using a "sub-mixer" through this "aux in" jack.'}
