{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007IBE15E', 'answerTime': 'Dec 20, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387526400, 'question': 'Does this unit have effects send/receive ports and are they mono or stereo. We have an older unit, and manuals are not available.', 'answer': "The unit does have effects but they are poorly done and I usually don't use them. They claim to have reverb but actually it is just a shorter echo length. Not sure what you mean by send/receive ports but it does have 4 outputs on the back that I use in stereo mode. It operates the same as the larger mixers but with only 4 inputs. I find it to be a tremendous value and have used it multiple times to DJ smaller venues."}
