{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007K3EGXW', 'answerTime': 'Jun 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403679600, 'question': 'How do I know if this is the right octive/pitch for my ukulele? I have a Hilo Model # 2656.', 'answer': 'Is your ukelele a concert ukelele or a soprano or a tenor? The sopranos are the small ones (21 in), concert is medium (23 in) and tenor are the bigger ones (26 in). these strings are for the concert size. If yours is a different size, just search either soprano or tenor and you will get the right size.'}
