{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007PDRVOI', 'answerTime': 'Dec 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419235200, 'question': 'if you put heavier strings on ,are the any adjustments that would be required? I have no knowledge of set up procedures.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Heavier strings have a higher tension so they will pull on the neck harder thus raising the action. Once you put the heavier strings on, you will likely need to tighten (turn clockwise) the truss rod in the neck to counter the higher tension of the heavier strings. Look down the strings from the bridge like a gun barrel to see the slope in the neck (action).'}
