{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007QB57WM', 'answerTime': 'Aug 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407135600, 'question': 'Will this fit a Sennheiser Freeport Presentation set Model fp 12-B-US. Bodypack transmitter SK-2-b (replacement for a clip on microphone, omni ME 2-2', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "The body pack uses a standard 3.5mm jack. So this headset should fit fine as long as you buy the one that is for Sennheiser. They also make a couple of headsets for Shure and another brand, those will not fit the Senns. To add to the note, I have one of these on a Pastor who fiddled constantly the with standard over-one-ear mic. I was going to put him on a stationary mic out of desperation, until I found this.. This one fits him fine and the sound quality is fine. I don't recommend it for singing however, but for speech it works."}
