{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007T8OGLK', 'answerTime': 'May 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401001200, 'question': 'Can it handle a bass, passive or active?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I don't see why it wouldn't handle bass, though I've never tried it with bass. But with the octave effect being so subtle with guitar, I don't think it will have much effect on bass. It is a pretty cool, raunchy fuzz sound. Well worth the price. At least for use with guitar."}
