{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007X968RA', 'answerTime': 'Jul 15, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373871600, 'question': 'Can the LED ribbon be cut to a shorter length? If so, where to cut?', 'answer': "Yes, it can be cut from what I have read. Between the emitters. (When you look at the ribbon, you'll see that it's essentially a series of 4 color emitter squares evenly spaced. From what I have read, you simply cut it between these.) I chose not to cut mine, even though it was a tad too long. I simply made a U on each end and have slightly brighter lights on the ends."}
