{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0082JF2JU', 'answerTime': 'Jan 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389168000, 'question': 'WIll these fit in a 4mm bore hole?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I installed these in an old silvertone. The original holes were worn to the point that they were eccentric (not sharing a common center with the posts..ovalar) I drilled them out and pushed in some bushings ( http://www.amazon.com/Bushings-Fender%C2%AE-vintage-tuning-pieces/dp/B00A8Q1HAI/ref=sr_1_4?ie=UTF8&qid=1389205120&sr=8-4&keywords=Nickel+bushings+tuning+hardware) which fit the tuners perfectly. Not sure of the diameter.'}
