{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0083FTVB8', 'answerTime': 'Dec 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418025600, 'question': 'Can this be easily connected to a TV to have the words shown there? Single non-technical Mom needs it to be fairly easy.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Your recording device/phone has a USB port (that part of the charger that goes into the computer or the charger plug itself) check to see if you TV has a USB port and you are good to go. You can also get a jack that can be used with both the TV and Memorex. Merry Christmas and good luck.'}
