{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0085IXEYS', 'answerTime': 'Jun 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1372143600, 'question': 'will these lights work around the top of a pool above the waterline? How many sets can you use together?What all acesseries do I need to use 5 strips', 'answer': "Well, I would say yes and no...The tape doesn't really stick good first off. With some type of water proof glue you could get away with the actual light strip being pool side. Then when it comes to the strip connecting to it's power box source you would have to use some kind of water proof type like electrical tape to seal the easily exposed connect in/outlets. I hope that information helped.Good luck friend."}
