{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0085M6SUQ', 'answerTime': 'Feb 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391760000, 'question': 'does this karaoke keep a score when the person sings?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Sorry, but no idea what you mean by "score". This karaoke device is found in some big stores in the "toy" section. I have read comments from Adults and Senior Citizens saying how fun it was to use it. I got it for my 7 year old son, and he and his friends enjoy playing with it, using the microphones "pretending" being famous singers. It seems you are looking for a very sophisticated electronic device that shows the quality of your voice. I don\'t remember having seen anything in this karaoke that "measures" and "rates" the voice.'}
