{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0087UPW58', 'answerTime': 'Dec 5, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386230400, 'question': 'what are the height adjustment measurements, it will be used by a 10 year old petite', 'answer': "Don't remember the exact numbers of the adjustments but there are 3 of them. My draught was 7 when we bought it and now she's 8 and is 48 inches tall. She used it for a keyboard. Now she has a piano with another bench. I'm sorry if I was no help."}
