{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0087UPXG6', 'answerTime': 'Sep 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410159600, 'question': 'what is the weight', 'answer': 'Shipping weight is stated as 9.2 lbs but my guess is around 4-5 lbs max.'}
