{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008MI70QE', 'answerTime': 'Sep 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410937200, 'question': "How's the fretwork? Does it need much fine-tuning? I wouldn't expect too much, but I'm curious...", 'answer': "Fretwork was tight , I went over it lightly out of habit. If they're all like mine then you cant lose. Im comparing this to necks already on guitars as this is the first neck Ive ever purchased new. Ive been playing about 20yrs only builing since last year, hope that helps."}
