{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008R7F32I', 'answerTime': 'Jun 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402556400, 'question': 'Does anyone know what makes this more expensive than the 2300? They look to be the same...', 'answer': "Casio CTK-3200 has Touch Response and Pitch Bend Wheel on left side of keyboard. Touch Response - Let's you add delicate nuances to notes by varying how much pressure you apply to keyboard keys. Pitch Bend Wheel - Rotate the wheel to slide the pitch of the sound being output upwards or downwards. This effect comes in handy when reproducing the sound of ethnic instruments, etc."}
