{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00923H7MA', 'answerTime': 'Jul 22, 2013', 'unixTime': 1374476400, 'question': 'how loud is the metronome for piano playing? I use headphones when I play piano', 'answer': 'if you are using headphones I guess it would depend on the volume you are listening at. The Korg is not particularly loud even with the volume all the way up. However, there is a headphone jack so possibly the two sources could be joined to the phones. In addition, there is a blinking light which enables you to see the tempo.'}
