{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0093UPG48', 'answerTime': 'Nov 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415779200, 'question': 'It is now november 2014. it appears that this product comes with maschine 2.0. is this correct?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I ordered mine back in May 2014, and it came with 1.8 in the box, and as soon as I registered my copy of 1.8 NI sent me a reg code for 2.0. I'm pretty sure that it will either come with 2.0 in the box or allow for a download. Version 2.2 is supposed to be out in November 2014."}
