{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0094D3JI4', 'answerTime': 'Oct 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414479600, 'question': 'does the px350 have an aux line out like the yamaha p105 that is "true line-output, the built-in speakers remain on for monitoring"?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It has two 1/4" headphone out jacks that disable the built in speakers, and two 1/4" line out jacks that do not.'}
