{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0094D3K2Y', 'answerTime': 'Feb 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393056000, 'question': 'After I got the piano one of the key does not play any sound? Has any one encountered this issue or do I have to return the piano', 'answer': "I've had one for over a year now, I think your best bet is to return it since I never ran across the issue it might just be a defective piece."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0094D3K2Y', 'answerTime': '10 days ago', 'question': "Does the piano produce a toy like sound? Because Lauryn's older piano made a toy like sound.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Nothing toy-like about this keyboard. Full, rich sound with a variety of settings. Very pleased with both the sound and the touch. Love it!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0094D3K2Y', 'answerTime': 'Apr 15, 2015', 'unixTime': 1429081200, 'question': 'When I play harder does it make a louder sound? And when I play softer, does it make a softer sound? Realistic to a real piano?', 'answer': "Yes. It does simulate the piano and forte sounds pretty well. Not as great as a 'real', or what is called an acoustic, but pretty good."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0094D3K2Y', 'answerTime': 'Apr 15, 2015', 'unixTime': 1429081200, 'question': "How difficult is it to move? I've averaged about 1 move per year for the last 5 years. Can one person move it? Could it fit in a regular car?", 'answer': 'The item is 53.25"L x 11.75"D x 32.5"H and weighs about 70.5lbs, without the stand. It may need 2 people to move it and depending on the size vehicle you have, it may fit.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0094D3K2Y', 'answerTime': 'Apr 14, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428994800, 'question': 'Does it have weighted keys? Does it feel like playing a real piano?', 'answer': "Yes, the keys are weighted. To an accomplished pianist, it might not feel quite the same as a real piano - but to a casual piano player (student, really) such as myself, it's close enough for my purposes."}
