{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0095G2LDY', 'answerTime': 'Sep 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411196400, 'question': "How can the extra buttons be programmed? I can't find a manual on how to set the DIY buttons.", 'answer': "I have no clue and gave up trying after a day. Try looking on youtube. I also found that the fish really, really don't like rapid changes in lighting or colors. Slow fades are ok if that's your thing, but rapid changes gave some of my fish what looked like seizures, so I'd suggest picking a color for mood lighting and leave it there. Change the color as you like, but don't have it cycling rapidly between colors. I feel the health of the animal is more important than my amusement."}
