{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009EK8PUY', 'answerTime': 'Dec 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387958400, 'question': 'can you use karaoke apps with this machine or do you have to load a CD to play the songs', 'answer': 'You can use karaoke apps on your iPad and connect it to the karaoke machine for sound... But the lyrics will show on your tablet, not on the tv. I loaded Instalyrics too... Not strictly karaoke but a lot of fun. Play anything you have in your iTunes or music library -when the music starts go to Instalyrics - the app will find lyrics so you can singalong. Connecting up to this karaoke machine gives you the benefit of good sound and the mic.'}
