{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009F8UAVM', 'answerTime': 'Mar 4, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425456000, 'question': 'How does it compare with the Yamaha GL1?', 'answer': 'I bought both. I did not like the Yamaha GL1 so I gave it away as a gift. The problem I had with the Yamaha was the width of the neck. It seemed very wide. Felt like I was playing a 12 string or a very wide neck Spanish guitar. So if you like a wide neck the Yamaha would be the one, the Cordoba worked better for me as the neck was smaller and seemed easier to play. I hope that helps'}
