{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009FOY13O', 'answerTime': '8 days ago', 'question': "Hello, I was wondering when I plug the guitar to my home speaker or headset, I can't hear anything. Do I need other accessories? Thanks", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "You need to plug it into a POWERED amplifier. Headphones and home speakers aren't powered. Take the guitar into any shop or to a friend who plays and they can plug it into an AMP for you. Then if you don't get any sound, there is a problem with the output on the guitar, but that is probably unlikely."}
