{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009NWX2WO', 'answerTime': 'Apr 2, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427958000, 'question': 'I have a pair of pioneer hpm 60 speakers, will this model (the 200) support these speakers? They weight 38.5 lbs.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'yeah the stands can handle that kinda weight. My speakers weigh almost 50 lbs each and these stands handle the weight. I would advise against "sliding" the stands around after the speakers have been placed upon them, however.'}
