{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A7I7DH8', 'answerTime': 'Aug 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407135600, 'question': 'How do I connect my laptop to this mixer?', 'answer': 'As far as I know, the only ways to connect a laptop is out the headphone jack into 1/4" or XLR and use 2 channels panned left and right or out of your USB into a gigaport or some other sound card and then into the channels on the mixer. The USB input on the mixer is only for playing music directly from a flash drive or external drive. I have not worked with it enough to know if there are other options. I hope that helps.'}
