{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A92VFHG', 'answerTime': 'Jan 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388995200, 'question': 'Just to clarify this is an Upgrade to cubase 7.5 from cubase le or ai right? Also does it come with a usb elicenser (aka usb dongle)?', 'answer': 'Yes, it is an upgrade from LE and AI, and, No, it does not come with a USB dongle. Thanks.'}
