{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AC5AXSM', 'answerTime': 'Jan 8, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420704000, 'question': 'i notice there is another mini kinta with blue lens, is there a difference on the light that will be projected?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'No, the kinta projects diffent colors. It just depends on when the photo was taken.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00AC5AXSM', 'answerTime': 'Jan 8, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420704000, 'question': 'Can you set which color you want the system to project, or does it project different colors all at once?', 'answer': 'Just happens I had my system set up. You can DMX the color you like but on Auto-sound active, you get a nice flow of color, one at color at time. I have not needed to just have one color fill. I really like the sound active part of it, as I am just using in as a filler on stage. Hope this helps.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00AC5AXSM', 'answerTime': 'Dec 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419235200, 'question': 'I have to put the Kinta right next to my powerful subwoofer for it to kick into sound active mode even if I play on loud volume. Defective?', 'answer': 'My Kinta is also very insensitive to sound, basicly these were designed to be in a small area/room with an insane amount of bass/volume to trigger.'}
