{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AFNHT3I', 'answerTime': 'Jul 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404198000, 'question': 'Can anyone verify that this includes the audiotechnica locking 4-pin plug adapter? The description says it works with AT, but AT adapter not pictured.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "It comes with the four adapters as shown. Two of them are locking adapters:a 4 pin and a 3 pin. I don't know if the four pin is the audiotechnica style, but it is configured with the pins like a Y and the pins are at each end of the Y, and one pin in the center. For the money, this over the ear mic is amazing."}
