{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AFNHT3I', 'answerTime': 'Dec 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418544000, 'question': 'Will this work with the Shure BLX1 bodypack transmitter?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I do not think so but I can't say for sure. I would highly recommend buying a good mic. I know this one looks like a good option because of the price but having purchased a number of them and having tried to deal with PYLE customer service, the name says it all. They are a PYLE of junk."}
