{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00ANIIY9I', 'answerTime': 'Jan 26, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422259200, 'question': 'Will this work with a Roku?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'This is not intended to be used with a Roku. The Roku has HDMI output to the TV. HDMI carries both audio and video signals. The Panlong is a digital (optical) to analog converter. I have on older stereo with RCA speaker inputs. so, this will take the optical audio out from my tv and convert it to an analog signal my older stereo can use. so, no it will not work with a Roku directly.'}
