{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00AYLLCHU', 'answerTime': 'Jun 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403420400, 'question': 'I cant string the kit. With the vibrato bridge. I tried some videos online but they were useless, i have the spring set under the bar but it hangs in there loose and as i tighten my strings the whammy pulls back and the strings pop out, any help would...', 'answer': "With the posts set in the bridge, but facing forward, the string bead gets placed on the post, strung underneath, and then around the bottom. Then, you'll string the strings underneath the front portion and onward up the neck."}
