{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AYLLCHU', 'answerTime': 'Dec 13, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386921600, 'question': 'Sorry for my inexperience with guitars but my question is, does a semi hollow guitar like this one makes any sound even when not plugged? thanks', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Thank you for your interest in our guitar kit listing. This is an electric guitar with a semi body design. Unlike an acoustic guitar it will need to plug to an amplifier. Let us know if you have any other question. Thank you. Happy holidays.'}
