{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AZ98Z8U', 'answerTime': 'Jan 15, 2015', 'unixTime': 1421308800, 'question': 'Can this be down loaded on more than one computer?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Not sure what you're asking. Your license will allow you to run it on more than one computer (at least two, check online with Ableton for more specifics). If you're downloading a full copy, then just install it over your network or burn a copy and hand carry it (sneakernet) to the second machine. If it's just an install stub (that takes you to the website for installation), then you shouldn't have a problem, as you don't have to register the installation until you actually run the program for the first time."}
