{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AZUAORE', 'answerTime': 'Apr 22, 2015', 'unixTime': 1429686000, 'question': 'what additional item(s) would I need to hook this up to a cello?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'This answer is a bit redundant. The most important element is a high quality pickup. I suggest consulting with the folks at Fishman. Other than that, two cables and a high quality acoustic amp. Again, Fishman produces very high quality, neutrally colored amps. You may want to consider some type of delay, reverb or acoustic processor, all dependent on your ultimate sound desires. Again, call Fishman, they know acoustic sound. The direct number is 978 988 9199.'}
