{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B28HDH2', 'answerTime': 'Nov 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417334400, 'question': 'Besides the mic capability, what is the deference between the accustic amp and a standard gutar amp?', 'answer': 'Some differences. acoustic amps are generally only clean sounding, no distortion, but some limited chorus effects. standard guitar amps have stronger reverb and many have extended virtual amp effects such as distortion amps, acoustic amps and heavy metal amp sounds including chorus, reverb, echo, delay, etc.'}
