{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B2UOISW', 'answerTime': 'Feb 17, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424160000, 'question': 'How does the Hobbit ocarina compare to the "Forest Whisperer" wooden ocarina also on Amazon? Curious if anyone has tried both.', 'answer': "As I have not tried both, I cannot say exactly. This being said, the Hobbit ocarina is ceramic, and most are clay or ceramic. STL Ocarina makes amazing ocarinas of many kinds. I just have the hobbit, but from what I've seen, they are all great, and I would bet on those."}
