{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00B3DXHFS', 'answerTime': 'Jul 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404198000, 'question': 'Can you tune it like a regular guitar?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes...and no. Yes, it\'s tuned in "fourths" like a guitar, so you play the 5th fret on the lowest string to tune the next higher string just like a guitar. But, you can\'t really tune it to E, there\'s not enough string tension. So the top and bottom strings are tuned to A. So it\'s like playing a regular guitar with a capo at the fifth fret.'}
