{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B3K9LMO', 'answerTime': 'Nov 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1416211200, 'question': 'What items will I need to purchase to ensure the mics work? Also, any recommendations for amplifiers or speakers? Thanks!', 'answer': 'You will a couple 9 volt batteries and an amp. You can buy a relatively inexpensive guitar amp on Amazon that will fine. Guitar amps produce a nice full frequency range for vocals. You will hear both microphones through the amp.'}
