{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B41JIY8', 'answerTime': 'Jan 4, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420358400, 'question': 'Can this mic be used with other devices that have a 1/4" mic Input? Is it "Forward Compatible"?', 'answer': 'As these are condenser mics powered by the Iphone connector [30 pin or lightning depending on your devise] I don\'t believe you can use them with any other device w/o some serious interface converter between them. You could, however, use your iphone/pad as that interface with a proper 1/8" to 1/4" connecting cable, between your head phone out and other device input.'}
