{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BHCMFXU', 'answerTime': 'Apr 15, 2015', 'unixTime': 1429081200, 'question': 'I have this guitar -- you think it will fit?', 'answer': "What guitar? I have a bunch of guitars and fits on all of them but one that has an 80's Yamaha tremolo. The only way to make it fit will be trimming one side of the bridge pickup mounting ring. I'm sure you'll be fine, though."}
