{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BHN05H2', 'answerTime': 'Mar 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395817200, 'question': 'My microphone did not come with a foam piece. Does the foam piece on the mic even make a difference in the recording/sound quality? Thanks!', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Theoretically yes, the foam piece is intended to reduce the pickup of background noise and the "boom" effect of certain speech sounds such as Ps and Ts. You could use it without it, but I\'d recommend having it.'}
