{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BID0C1U', 'answerTime': 'Aug 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407394800, 'question': 'Can the dimmer be placed in a convienient place?anywhere inline,or next to the plugin?', 'answer': 'The dimmer is fixed in the middle of a cable roughly about a foot in length with 2 permanent connections on each end. One end connects to your led lights (via a 6" adapter cable) and the other goes to the power adapter. Unless you can find an extension cable, you will have about a foot of play from the end of your light strip to where you can mount the dimmer switch.'}
