{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BISVN54', 'answerTime': 'Aug 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408950000, 'question': 'Can the keyboard be separated from the stand? Is there a sustain pedal jack or do you have to use the three pedals on the stand?', 'answer': 'Yes the keyboard comes separated from the stand and can be separated later for transport but it cannot sit on a table without some sort of support as the bottom is not flat. There is no sustain peddle jack. It is just an electrical plug-in from the wires going to the 3 pedals. I have seen sustain jacks on other keyboards and this is not one of them.'}
