{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BJ58AAC', 'answerTime': 'Feb 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393142400, 'question': 'What is actually included in this "bundle"? Thanks.', 'answer': 'What I recieved was this: A Pop filter, the samson microphone, a pair of samson head phones, and a cleaning whipe. The cord of the microphone is also really long if you need to put it in far places from the computer'}
