{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BJ58AAC', 'answerTime': 'Sep 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1378450800, 'question': 'Does this work with Windows 8?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It sure does. I use Audacity on an Asus Windows 8 laptop and have had no problems with it detecting the mic.'}
