{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BQ6KSN6', 'answerTime': 'Jan 29, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422518400, 'question': "I just want to throw this question out there for polls. In terms of the quality (let's say they are the same price), BEHRINGER XENYX 302USB or this?", 'answer': "The Behringer is actually a mixer and does a whole lot more. At this level the preamps are not much different. The M-Audio has midi. Long story short, if you don't need midi, go with the Behringer."}
