{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BQ6KSMW', 'answerTime': 'Jan 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390809600, 'question': 'Is this controller easy-to-use for a novice', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It's easy to use if you've used other MIDI controllers with your DAW before. The biggest thing that you'll have to learn is about mapping the individual knobs, sliders, and buttons to your DAW if you're not using Ignite which comes with it. Also getting around the HyperControl can be tricky, but Google and YouTube are your friend for that situation."}
