{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BQOHUHK', 'answerTime': '23 days ago', 'question': 'can we use two of these speakers together for broader audio coverage with an event in a larger space?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, I believe that would work out well. The speaker gives a LOT of coverage. We had someone in one room and people two rooms over (in a large restaurant/bar-type venue) and you could hear perfect with one speaker. Based on feedback I received, I would recommend putting them on the tripod for even better coverage.'}
