{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BRQ57FE', 'answerTime': 'Jan 26, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422259200, 'question': 'We just got several of these microphones for our musical theater group. At rehearsal, we are experiencing a lot of cutting on/off. Any suggestions ?', 'answer': 'If you are using multiple ones then they may be interfering with each other....try switching the channels on both the receiving decks and the headsets (each set is on a different channel to match the receiving deck). I use mine at a gym and whenever there is interference this usually clears it up for me.'}
