{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00C10964I', 'answerTime': 'Mar 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395817200, 'question': 'Can the pedal only be used for Whammy/Volume/Wah/Pitch Shifter or can it be used to control the slicer/rotary/phaser speeds as well?', 'answer': 'Defaults to volume or with a toe-click it can adjust wah or pitch shift. The 2nd mode defaults to wah and only does pitch shift when that mode is selected on the amp. It can not adjust any other setting ranges.'}
