{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00C10964I', 'answerTime': 'Jul 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405926000, 'question': "What's the difference between this and the old version? It looks like they both have the same picture on Amazon. What about the silver version?", 'answer': 'I had both the black one and the silver one....both are the same. Depends on what color you want. The silver one is the first edition...so you might be able to get a better deal. I liked the black one because it matched every thing I had better. Both operates exactly the same. Be aware you will need to adjust the pedal switch to operate correctly on either one. See YouTube'}
