{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00C17KWZ8', 'answerTime': 'Jan 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390377600, 'question': 'I have 6 lines hooked up with amps at the end of each line, can I hook the music Controller out of my changing led start control? One line 80 foot long going around my patio.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes, the controller would be at the beginning of the 1st strip: (controller)-(strip_1)-(amp_1)-(strip_2)-(amp_2)-(strip_3)..(amp_n-1)-(strip_n). The controller and each of the amplifiers need to be connected to their power sources.'}
