{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CBU9H0G', 'answerTime': 'Jan 14, 2015', 'unixTime': 1421222400, 'question': 'Firstly, how do you use a midi device such as a keyboard with this?', 'answer': 'Directly you cannot plug a MIDI keyboard to this. This is purely audio interface without direct MIDI In/Out. You can use it with DAW. NOw if you want to use MIDI Key board then if your keyboard has USB MIDI I/O you have to connect it to your laptop/desktop. Your MIDI will be available in DAW or other MIDI enabled program. If your keyboard has only 5-pin MIDI IN/OUT then you have to get a USB-MIDI interface or a MIDI/IO Card for desktop. If you want more clarification please reply. Thanks.'}
