{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CDA0IUC', 'answerTime': 'Sep 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380092400, 'question': 'what the battery life? And what kind?', 'answer': "I've had mine for a few months and have never changed the battery. There are no signs of power loss either. You just have to turn it off when you're not using it. It uses a round watch type battery that comes with the tuner. I like mine. Not as accurate as a tuner app that I have but great for quick, ballpark tuning!"}
