{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CE0VN3M', 'answerTime': 'Jan 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390550400, 'question': "Question for DJ's: EV ZLX15p or Mackie SRM 450 V2? Which is overall better?", 'answer': 'I prefer EVs. I think the quality is better and the range of the speakers. I use 2 15 and no sub for my events. My sound goes crazy.'}
{'answer': 'Hi To answer your question correctly, they both are 1000 watts , the main difference is the 15 inch has more full body sound and you can also use it without any sub if place you are playing is not big enough for adding a subwoofer . I would use the 12 for smaller venue up to 50 people vs the 15 that can handle over 75-100 people. Hope you are comfortable with my explanation and if you do need further assistance , you are welcome to call us 718/272/7228 . Thanks . Mike', 'asin': 'B00CE0VN3M', 'answerTime': '18 days ago', 'question': 'zlx 15p vs zlx 12p wich is better ??', 'questionType': 'open-ended'}
