{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00CE20FC0', 'answerTime': 'Nov 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415347200, 'question': 'Is there a schematic online for this pickup?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Red aand white wires are coil tap and are wired together. Green goes to the volume pot lug and black and bare wire are soldered to the back of the volume pot. To get a single coil sound ground the red and white pair of wires using a switch or push-pull pot. Hope this helps.'}
