{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CICPN0K', 'answerTime': 'Feb 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392278400, 'question': 'Does this work automatically with Linux distros like Ubuntu or specialised distros like Audiophile Linux?', 'answer': 'It does work with Ubuntu out of the box. I can\'t speak to other distros, but I know Schiit has put effort into this product working with Linux. They\'ve marketed it a few times and demonstrated it running on Ubuntu and as the M&M stack being good sound that young people can actually afford. And it running on Linux was a big part of that. So I would assume that anything called "Audiophile Linux", which I have previously not heard of, would be right up their alley for this product.'}
