{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00CICPN0K', 'answerTime': 'Mar 2, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425283200, 'question': 'will this DAC allow me to connects PC iPod android device to my vintage pioneer stereo with only rca r l inputs?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'What is a "PC Ipod Android device"? If you mean PC/Computer, then yes. No, an Ipod or Android device probably will not work with it. Possibly with an android device with tons of work and a way to get a line out connection with the charger port.'}
