{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CP4IIJY', 'answerTime': 'Feb 3, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422950400, 'question': 'How well does it work with Windows 7?', 'answer': 'It works just fine with both Win 7 and Win 8.1... I will say that under either OS, if I leave the interface up, eventually the USB drops the connection with the PC and I have to power cycle the unit or unplug and plug back in the USB cable. There may be newer drivers which address this or it maybe configurations I can modify on my PC. But to your question, "how well does it work," I get smooth streaming sound when I\'m working with it ... did you have specific requirements in mind?'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CP4IIJY', 'answerTime': 'Dec 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419062400, 'question': 'Will this unit allow sufficiently loud &amp; non-distorted monitoring with TWO 300-ohm top-notch pro headphones? How good ARE the headphone amps?', 'answer': 'I use Grado and AT pro phones. The amps are sufficient. About the same quality of sound as running direct to the mixing board from the 6i6.'}
