{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CUS6J2I', 'answerTime': 'Jan 24, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422086400, 'question': 'How sturdy is the clip? I bought a snark for my acoustic guitars a few years back and the clip lasted for all of two days before it broke.', 'answer': 'This is the first clip on tuner I have had, but this little guy seems great all the way around. I have used it a dozen times and the clip is strong and sturdy.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CUS6J2I', 'answerTime': 'Sep 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410332400, 'question': 'I use Open E and open D tunings Will It show me the G# and F# notes on the G string?', 'answer': "It has a chromatic setting. That won't be an issue."}
