{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00DND2SN8', 'answerTime': 'Aug 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409468400, 'question': 'I dont understand how to size the strings, how do I know if these would work for my accustic electric', 'answer': 'They are standard steel strings, just like any other strings (Fender, Gibson, Ernie Ball), except with colors. So they fit any acoustic, electric or acoustic-electric steel string guitar.'}
