{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00DPVLTP6', 'answerTime': 'Feb 9, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423468800, 'question': 'Has anyone had any experience using this with an Arduino or Raspberry Pi? If so, would you mind telling me how you did it or what libraries you used?', 'answer': "I've used either BLIP_LEDS_SPI_LPD6803 or LPD6803_RGB_Pixels_master library's for the Arduino or a Raspberry Pi with the Falcon Pi Player software with a DMX to SPI Smart Pixel Decoder or E1.31 & ArtNet to SPI Pixel Controller connected to the LED Strip(s)with xLights_Nutcracker to sequence."}
