{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00E6Y7NS8', 'answerTime': 'Feb 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393488000, 'question': 'Why does the Supcase come with a reminder card saying to remove the nexus when charging? Is there a problem?', 'answer': "This type of question should be directed to the manufacturer. One should always follow the manufacturers instructions. My wife has a Supercase. She doesn't remember any reminder card. She has charged her Nexus with the case on with no problems for the last 2 months. That doesn't mean it is safe to do so. It just means we haven't had problems or know about this problem."}
