{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00E6Y7NS8', 'answerTime': 'Aug 31, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377932400, 'question': 'How can this be for the latest 2nd generation? There are reviews dating back several years and the device just came out in July of 13?', 'answer': "As I stated in an earlier review, this case works fine for the Nexus 7 that I have because mine does NOT have a rear facing camera. However the new Nexus 7's do have a rear facing camera and the SUPCASE that I bought will not allow you to take photos with that rear camera. Inspect what you are going to buy very carefully."}
