{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00EADCPDS', 'answerTime': 'Mar 30, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427698800, 'question': 'Having trouble getting it to join the DMX universe with rest of stage lights. Trying to set fixture to 3 channel DMX on ch. 9,10,11. Any suggestions?', 'answer': "Press menu until you get to D001. Press up until you se D009 and press enter. Some fixtures are sold as a 7 ch or 6ch, the seller doesn't know the difference. I have 12 3ch units and now that some are breaking I can't find the only 3ch units. And the 7ch units that can be set to 3ch will reset when the power is cycled. Cheap lights. Good luck"}
