{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00EB124RQ', 'answerTime': 'Aug 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408604400, 'question': 'the cost $58 is for the the set to 6 Tuners?', 'answer': 'Hi Carlos, if you want to put locking tuners on a "vintage" american made stratocaster as I did, $58 is a good deal for these. Mine were very easy to install -- I did not even have to remove the original head bushing or use the screws provided -- just insert the tuner into the original bushing! More important, the locking tuners keep my strat in tune! \'Nuf said. Cheers.'}
