{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00EIMZG46', 'answerTime': 'Mar 6, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425628800, 'question': 'Does the TC Tuner act as a buffer in the signal chain, similar to Boss TU-2?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I don't use long cables causing signal loss, so there is no buffering noticed. Aditionally, there is no mentioning of buffer feature on the pedal manual. If you realy need this feature get a Morley AB switch. It's affordable and you still can you the TC, which is great!"}
