{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00ELJM1WQ', 'answerTime': 'Jul 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404370800, 'question': 'Is the 12 hole alto c legend of Zelda ceramic ocarina sold from Ocarina Wind worth buying? What is the sound quality?', 'answer': "I hate to speak outright negatively of a product, but in this case I don't feel that it can be avoided. The sound quality of the instrument overall is very low compared to almost any other ceramic 12-hole ocarina. Moreover, this ocarina can't even come close to playing some of the notes a 12-hole is supposed to be able to play - the D, E, and F at the top of the range reached by lifting the thumbs and left-hand pinky, and the A and B reached by covering all the holes plus the sub-holes. I think almost any alternative would be better."}
