{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00EM5UOBE', 'answerTime': 'Feb 7, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423296000, 'question': 'I notice there is only one input for a footswitch.Is it strickly to change from a clean sound to efx,will it change settings on efx', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It changes from clean channel 1 to fx channel 2, the 2nd button on foot switch them turns on the special fx you set up on each channel respectfully. It is truly one of the best amps i have ever had...the sound is really exactly what anyone would want or ever need.'}
