{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00EM5UOE6', 'answerTime': '28 days ago', 'question': 'will this amp work for Accordians?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Not sure. I am not sure how accordions have their sound amplified. The Champion is really suited for guitars with magnetic pickups. I use piezo pickups with my guitars, and feedback can be a problem. My guess is that accordions could run into the same issues with feedback. Also, this amp uses a quarter inch jack. I am not sure what an accordion uses. I would do more research if I were you.'}
