{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00EO5Q6L4', 'answerTime': 'Nov 28, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385625600, 'question': 'Can someone measure their Rokit 6 g3\'s for me? Amazon says "Product Dimensions: 17 x 12 x 14 inches" but they don\'t look that big. Thanks in advance', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I just measured mine for you... They\'re not that big. Perhaps that\'s the size when they\'re boxed up? Here are the dimensions measured from my Rokit 6\'s (G3) just now: 10.5" deep, 8.75" wide, 12.5" tall. On the depth, you\'ll want to plan for maybe another 1 inch or so because you\'ll have the cable sticking out somewhat. Hope that helps!'}
