{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00EO5Q6L4', 'answerTime': 'Jul 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405839600, 'question': 'Any diff btw purchasing 2 units vs 1 pair? Will the "pair" be more acoustically matched by the manufacturer? Or I\'m thinking too much...?', 'answer': "You need to get 1 pair, these are monitors so the left one will be displaying the left pan sound, and the right will be doing the same for the right pan sound, so if you only buy one, you'll have to set the pan to only one monitor which won't be as powerful, hope I helped"}
