{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00EO7UNXO', 'answerTime': 'Nov 29, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385712000, 'question': 'Can you spec the exact cables I need to plug and play two of these into my computer? I am not too tech savvy.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Of course, i have mine plugged directly to my computer so it's a 3.5 mm standard headphone jack, but the monitors need 1/4, RCA, or XLR. I chose the 1/4 to 3.5mm, i bought these ones and are great: http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B005HGM1D6/ref=oh_details_o01_s00_i01?ie=UTF8&psc=1 -Esteban"}
