{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00F2ATEDC', 'answerTime': 'Feb 20, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424419200, 'question': "I turned it on for the first time, and nothing is coming out. It is just making a very loud noise. What's wrong?", 'answer': "Make sure it's warmed up to the green light comes on then try. Also make sure black tube that feeds the machine is all the way to the bottom of tank as well. If making a loud noise before green light comes on its deff a defective product send it back asap, that's all I can help with there."}
