{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00F3TFSXM', 'answerTime': 'Dec 30, 2013', 'unixTime': 1388390400, 'question': 'If you needed more then 16.4 ft, is there a way to hook up more then one to each other, and they all work together, for all the way around the house?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Dear friend, on each end of the RGB led strip, there is a 4 pin male and famale connector, you can connect two rolls into one strip. But please kindly note that it will need a 4A ~ 6A power supply for two rolls.'}
