{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00F5BN2WW', 'answerTime': 'Nov 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415347200, 'question': "I had the ns7 and all the pads and buttons for cues and loops had issues cuz of numark's cheap adhessive. any similar issues?", 'answer': 'So far no issues like that. All buttons are excellent. Only complaint with this unit is that you can forget about putting it on a plane. Even with the flight case the side knobs were badly damaged. It is also well over the usual 70lbs with the flight case. Other than that, it is fantastic.'}
