{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00GR9W1MS', 'answerTime': 'Dec 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419926400, 'question': 'Specs say 16.3" L to R and only 7.5" high? What is the actual overall L to R length with all panels open? Panel height?', 'answer': 'The side panels fold outward (which is nice) to give the unit a final width (when in use) of about 22" wide and about 12" high.'}
