{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00HJGIIO8', 'answerTime': 'Apr 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396335600, 'question': 'Is the bridge already on the violin?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'We will set up the bridge before it gets ship out, however, the bridge is held in place with the tension of the strings over the top edge. It may be dislocate or felt off during shipping. If that happen, you will have to set it up yourself or bring it to local music store to have it set up.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00HJGIIO8', 'answerTime': 'May 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1400137200, 'question': 'I just got my package. One of the string is broken!? can i change it??', 'answer': "Strings are delicate, and it can be broke in 1/2 during shipping or tuning. If you just receive the package, please contact your seller for replacement strings. It's always better to have an extra set for back up."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00HSPW57G', 'answerTime': 'Oct 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414047600, 'question': 'Does this have a music stand to hold sheet music?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes. It has a clear, plexiglass music stand that inserts into the back edge of the keyboard. It is sturdy and removable. I remember being pleasantly surprised when I unpacked the box and found it because I had never had one on any of my previous keyboards. Just another reason to love it. I've now had it almost 6 months and am still thrilled."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00HSPW57G', 'answerTime': 'Apr 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398495600, 'question': 'How many voices does this model boast?', 'answer': 'It has 24 preset voices which consist of Grand Piano: 4, E.Piano: 4, Organ: 4, CLV/VIB: 4, Others: 8. It also has 10 rhythms, and 2 track recording for up to 10 songs (approx. 1.5 MB memory).'}
