{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00JTR0MI0', 'answerTime': 'Jun 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403679600, 'question': 'Is it 4 pins or 5?', 'answer': 'The LED string connector has 4 pins. First pin is +12 volts, the other pins are the negative leads of red, green, and blue LED strings. The controller connects these to the negative of the 12 volts using PWM modulation to control brightness of each color.'}
